# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:915
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_875e2296:

    # mom "Y crees que estás empezando a desarrollar sentimientos por él, ¿no?"
    mom "And you think you're starting to develop feelings for him, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:917
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_c77fa3fa:

    # kim "¿Cómo lo sabes?"
    kim "How did you know?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:919
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_8c059369:

    # mom "Sólo hace falta verte cuando está cerca, cielo."
    mom "I only needed to see you when he's around, sunshine."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:920
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_dd583115:

    # mom "Cuando empezamos a sentir algo por alguien creemos que nadie se da cuenta, y tan solo no se dan cuenta quienes no nos ven... y [mc]."
    mom "When we start to feel something for someone, we think that nobody realizes it, and only those who don't see us don't notice... Well, those and [mc]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:921
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_cfec4b4f:

    # mom "Además, yo pasé por lo mismo, con lo que reconozco los síntomas."
    mom "Besides, I went through the same thing, so I recognize the symptoms."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:924
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_f922bef6:

    # kim "¿Qué? ¿Tú?"
    kim "What? You too?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:927
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_eb6333b2:

    # mom "Sí. Fue unos días antes de que llegarais. Me sentía confundida y creía que me estaba enamorando de mi propio hijo."
    mom "Yes. It was a few days before you arrived. I felt confused and thought I was falling in love with my own son."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:929
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_86bd4195:

    # mom "Sí. Fue unos días antes de que llegarais. Me sentía confundida y creía que me estaba enamorando de [mc]."
    mom "Yes. It was a few days before you arrived. I felt confused and thought I was falling in love with [mc]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:930
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_c3e1e9f9:

    # mom "Por suerte, [mc] tiene la costumbre de hablarlo todo y lo aclaramos muy rápido antes de que nadie saliera herido."
    mom "Luckily, [mc] has the habit of talking about everything and we cleared it up very quickly before anyone got hurt."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:931
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_3f4e2da7:

    # mom "Quizás deberías hacer lo mismo. ¿Lo has hecho ya?"
    mom "Maybe you should do the same. Have you done it yet?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:934
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_db849359:

    # kim "Por eso es un problema..."
    kim "That's the problem..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:936
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_2414f6c0:

    # mom "¿Te preocupa compartir a [mc] conmigo?"
    mom "Are you worried about sharing [mc] with me?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:938
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_58a888ab:

    # kim "Me preocupa cómo te vas a sentir tú si intento algo con [mc]. Salís juntos."
    kim "I'm worried about how you're going to feel if I make a move on [mc]. You're dating him..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:940
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_702f9a83:

    # kim "Y es tu hijo."
    kim "And he's your son."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:943
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_e11d19e1:

    # mom "Ya sabes que no tenemos una relación exclusiva y que no soy la única mujer con la que sale."
    mom "You know we're not exclusive and I'm not the only woman he's dating."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:944
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_8a03cbc8:

    # mom "No sé por qué me debería importar que una chica tan fantástica como tú se uniera al harén."
    mom "I don't know why it would be a problem that a girl as fantastic as you would join the harem."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:946
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_e1945317:

    # mom "Salimos juntos, pero nunca hemos hablado de exclusividad."
    mom "We're dating, but we've never talked about exclusivity."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:947
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_b53d6dcd:

    # mom "Si alguna vez [mc] se plantea tener un harén, me encantaría que tú formaras parte de él, si quieres."
    mom "If [mc] ever considers having a harem, I'd love for you to be part of it, if you want."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:948
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_79e93dbf:

    # mom "Pero para eso, primero tienes que hablar con él. ¿Lo has hecho ya?"
    mom "But for that, you have to talk to him first. Have you done that yet?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:950
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_1b5d5547:

    # kim "Lo intenté... o para ser más exactos, lo hablé."
    kim "I tried... or to be more exact, I talked to him about it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:951
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_198169d6:

    # kim "Se dio cuenta de que me pasaba algo cuando estaba cerca y me preguntó. No pude mentirle."
    kim "He could tell there was something wrong when he was around, and he asked me about it. I couldn't lie to him."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:953
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_031d8a54:

    # mom "¿Y qué dijo? No estaríamos hablando de esto si no te hubiera dado esperanzas."
    mom "And what did he say? We wouldn't be talking about this if he hadn't given you any hope."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:954
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_1976cc2f:

    # mom "Y si te dio falsas esperanzas se lo haremos pagar juntas."
    mom "And if he gave you false hope, we'll make him pay for it together."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:956
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_b9b815f2:

    # kim "No, se comportó muy bien. Le dije que me preocupaba tu opinión y dijo que no me daría una respuesta... o esperanzas... hasta que no lo hablara contigo."
    kim "No, he behaved very gentlemanly. I told him I was concerned about your opinion, and he said he wouldn't give me an answer... or any hope... until I discussed it with you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:958
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_c510c23b:

    # mom "Típico de [mc]. Él ya debería saber lo que yo iba a responder."
    mom "Typical of [mc]. He should already know what I was going to answer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:960
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_2874cf78:

    # mom "Me encantaría que salieras con mi hijo si los dos queréis."
    mom "I'd love for you to date my son if you both want to."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:962
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_d18c97e6:

    # mom "Me encantaría que salieras con [mc] si los dos queréis."
    mom "I'd love for you to date [mc] if you both want to."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:963
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_3ff3fc95:

    # mom "Pero quería que lo solucionaras en tus propios términos sin importar lo que él quisiera o pensara sobre mi respuesta."
    mom "But he wanted you to solve it on your own terms, no matter what he wanted or thought about my answer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:964
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_d73474a4:

    # mom "Y no te dio esperanzas para que, una vez te diera mi respuesta, todo dependiera de ti."
    mom "And he didn't give you hope so that, once I gave you my answer, everything would depend on you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:966
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_1a8e2c1a:

    # kim "Para lo inocente que es a veces, parece un plan muy taimado. *Risita*"
    kim "As naive as he sometimes is, it seems like a very sneaky plan. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:968
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_7b05d62a:

    # mom "Es muy inocente para muchas cosas, y eso me encanta de él, pero creo que está evolucionando mucho."
    mom "He's very naive about a lot of things, and I love that about him, but I think he's evolving a lot."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:969
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_73363c8b:

    # mom "Cuando volvió de la universidad, seguramente ni siquiera se hubiera dado cuenta de que te pasaba algo con él."
    mom "When he got back from college, he probably wouldn't even have noticed that something was going on with you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:971
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_f312157b:

    # mom "Además, él nunca ha empezado una relación por lo que sé."
    mom "Besides, he's never started a relationship as far as I know."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:972
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_3568dde2:

    # mom "[eil] y [sai] la empezaron ellas."
    mom "[eil] and [sai] started it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:974
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_871b8252:

    # mom "Yo también."
    mom "Me too."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:976
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_e7c3dbf8:

    # mom "Y ya sabes el resto."
    mom "And you know the rest."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:978
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_e7c3dbf8_1:

    # mom "Y ya sabes el resto."
    mom "And you know the rest."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:980
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_fbfe3c36:

    # kim "Es una posición muy cómoda por su parte, ¿no? Y un poco egoísta."
    kim "That's a very comfortable position for him to be in, isn't it? And a bit selfish."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:981
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_6bc0ada8:

    # kim "Somos nosotras las que tenemos que descubrir nuestros sentimientos y él aceptarlos o no."
    kim "We are the ones who have to reveal our feelings, and he only has to accept them or not."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:982
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_4965e1df:

    # kim "Nos tenemos que desnudar emocionalmente delante de él..."
    kim "We have to bare our soul in front of him..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:984
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_a85b66b0:

    # mom "Los hombres han estado en esa situación durante siglos."
    mom "Men have been in that situation for centuries."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:985
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_ef0dd453:

    # mom "[mc] le ha dado la vuelta. Solo plantéate una pregunta."
    mom "[mc] has turned it around. Just ask yourself one question."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:986
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_d9b392bf:

    # mom "¿Crees que [mc] está enamorado de ti?"
    mom "Do you think [mc] is in love with you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:988
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_aac4a38d:

    # kim "No lo sé... lo dudo."
    kim "I don't know... I doubt it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:989
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_2f1d5819:

    # kim "Aunque yo tampoco estoy enamorada de él... al menos no hasta las trancas..."
    kim "Although I'm not in love with him either... at least not head over heels..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:991
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_3ca6ab03:

    # mom "No te lo tomes a mal. Yo también lo dudo."
    mom "Don't take it the wrong way. But I doubt it also."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:992
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_314bd0a0:

    # mom "Pero crees que podría querer salir contigo, ¿no?"
    mom "But you think he might want to date you, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:994
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_fefa818e:

    # kim "Quiero creer que hay una posibilidad."
    kim "I want to believe there's a chance."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:995
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_94047155:

    # kim "Creo que le gusto físicamente."
    kim "I think he likes me physically."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:997
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_33940d17:

    # mom "Siguiente pregunta. ¿Por qué iba a salir contigo si no está enamorado de ti?"
    mom "Next question. Why would he date you if he's not in love with you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:998
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_fd703476:

    # mom "Que le gustes físicamente no es razón suficiente. La mayoría de los hombres follarían con una mujer que les atrae físicamente."
    mom "Liking you physically is not a good enough reason. Most men would sleep with a woman they find physically attractive."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:999
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_9a0d9210:

    # mom "Pero no necesariamente saldrían con ella."
    mom "But they wouldn't necessarily date her."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1001
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_abcbbfc6:

    # kim "No lo sé... ¿quieres decir que sólo va a querer tener sexo conmigo?"
    kim "I don't know... do you mean he's only going to want to have sex with me?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1003
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_928f1279:

    # mom "No, [kim]. [mc] no es así. Si tiene algo contigo será una relación completa, aunque no esté enamorado de ti."
    mom "No, [kim]. [mc] is not like that. If he has feelings for you, it will be a full relationship, even if he's not in love with you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1004
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_d99413a8:

    # mom "Al menos aún. Hace dos semanas que os conocéis. No ha tenido tiempo de enamorarse de ti."
    mom "At least not yet. You've only known each other for two weeks. He hasn't had time to fall in love with you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1006
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_62c88293:

    # kim "Eso es relativo... yo..."
    kim "That's relative... I..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1007
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_b0d215b6:

    # kim "Pero entonces... ¿por qué iba a querer salir conmigo?"
    kim "But then... why would he want to date me?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1008
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_f373e4f3:

    # kim "Cada vez lo entiendo menos."
    kim "I understand it less with every sentence you say."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1011
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_a331bc67:

    # mom "Porque [mc] es especial. Y no lo digo solo porque sea mi hijo."
    mom "Because [mc] is special. And I'm not just saying that because he's my son."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1013
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_191bc704:

    # mom "Porque [mc] es especial."
    mom "Because [mc] is special."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1014
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_c2878648:

    # mom "Si empieza a salir contigo será porque cree que puede funcionar a largo plazo. Porque cree que puede enamorarse de ti."
    mom "If he starts dating you, it's because he thinks it could work in the long term. Because he thinks he could fall in love with you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1015
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_36298f65:

    # mom "Y porque tú sí que estás enamorada de él. Necesitas estar con él."
    mom "And because you are in love with him. You NEED to be with him."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1017
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_8c43204d:

    # mom "No va a empezar algo contigo solo por sexo. Puede tener todo el sexo que quiera sin hacer daño a nadie."
    mom "He's not going to start something with you just for sex. He can have all the sex he wants without hurting anyone."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1018
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_885a257e:

    # mom "[mc] nunca haría daño a nadie a propósito. Y menos a alguien que... ¿cómo lo has dicho?... Se desnuda emocionalmente delante de él."
    mom "[mc] would never hurt anyone on purpose. Least of all someone who... how did you put it?... bares her soul in front of him."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1020
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_f407c1bf:

    # kim "Ahora que lo has dicho tú... he sonado un poco cursi, ¿verdad?"
    kim "Now that you mention it... it sounded a bit cheesy, didn't it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1022
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_429d5a9d:

    # mom "*Risa* ¿Sólo un poco?"
    mom "*Laugh* Just a bit?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1023
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_ae5ad05a:

    # mom "Dame otro abrazo."
    mom "Give me another hug."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1025
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_8678d4dc:

    # kim "Entonces, ¿no te importa que lo intente con él?"
    kim "So, don't you mind if I try something with him?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1026
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_4ebd8a22:

    # mom "No, cielo. No me importa. Nunca nadie me lo ha preguntado y no tengo ningún derecho a que me importe."
    mom "No, sweetie. I don't mind. No one has ever asked me, and I have no right to mind."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1027
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_80e22c85:

    # kim "Quizás no te lo han preguntado porque no te veían como una figura materna."
    kim "Maybe they didn't ask you because they didn't see you as a mother figure?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1029
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_a698c7bc:

    # mom "*Risa* ¿Ni siquiera [emm]?"
    mom "*Laugh* Not even [emm]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1030
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_058d4afa:

    # mom "Sobre el resto, es posible, mi niña."
    mom "About the rest, it's possible you are right, my girl."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1032
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_99baf584:

    # mom "Es posible, mi niña."
    mom "It's possible you are right, my girl."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1033
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_09f8f2c8:

    # kim "¿Tienes algo que hacer ahora mismo?"
    kim "Do you have anything to do right now?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1034
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_e5a87677:

    # mom "No, ¿por qué?"
    mom "No, why?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1035
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_b913a856:

    # kim "¿Podemos quedarnos así un rato?"
    kim "Can we stay like this for a while?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1036
translate english c24s002_Meanwhile_Kim_Mar_Kat_e1409d13:

    # mom "Todo el tiempo que necesites."
    mom "As long as you need, sweetie."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1040
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6060e500:

    # "Después de dejar el coche de [emm] vais al edificio administrativo de la iglesia."
    "After leaving [emm]'s car, you go to the church administrative building."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1041
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_cfc7b916:

    # "[bet] te pide que la acompañes."
    "[bet] asks you to accompany her."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1042
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_85239e04:

    # "[emm] también quiere entrar, pero después de una par de amenazas veladas, decidís que será mejor que os espere en la heladería de ayer."
    "[emm] also wants to join in, but after a couple of veiled threats to the church, you decide that it would be better if she waited for you at yesterday's ice cream parlor."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1044
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d85602db:

    # bet "Buenos días, Hermana. Tengo una cita con el Padre Segismund."
    bet "Good morning, Sister. I have an appointment with Father Segismund."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1045
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_47bf0303:

    # "Monja" "Lo siento, pero hoy solo tiene una cita..."
    "Nun" "I'm sorry, but he only has one appointment this morning..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1046
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b944fbfb:

    # bet "¿Con la Hermana Beatrix?"
    bet "With Sister Beatrix?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1047
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d51c2fc1:

    # "Monja" "Sí..."
    "Nun" "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1049
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6bfadaae:

    # "Monja" "¡Oh!"
    "Nun" "Oh!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1050
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_14313c58:

    # bet "Exacto. ¡Oh! Estuve ayer aquí."
    bet "Exactly. Oh! I was here yesterday."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1052
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_62b52cc3:

    # "Monja" "Debería haber venido con el hábito, Hermana."
    "Nun" "You should have come in your habit, Sister."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1053
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_15cbeab7:

    # bet "No es necesario para lo que vengo a hacer, Hermana."
    bet "It's not necessary for what I've come to do, Sister."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1054
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_8de12e98:

    # bet "¿Puedo pasar al despacho del Padre Segismund?"
    bet "May I go to Father Segismund's office?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1056
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_8022a41a:

    # "Monja" "Ya la acompaño..."
    "Nun" "I'll accompany you..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1057
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d4d72fbe:

    # bet "No es necesario, gracias. Conozco el camino. [mc], vamos."
    bet "It's not necessary, thank you. I know the way. [mc], let's go."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1059
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_347b8e48:

    # bet "Buenos días, Padre Segismund. Siéntate, [mc]."
    bet "Good morning, Father Segismund. Sit down, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1060
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3b61d44c:

    # "Segismund" "¡Hermana! ¿Qué hace vestida así? ¿Dónde está su hábito?"
    "Segismund" "Sister Beatrix! What are you doing dressed like that? Where is your habit?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1062
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_16083c4d:

    # bet "En mi maleta. Nos vamos hoy de Monterey."
    bet "In my suitcase. We're leaving Monterey today."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1064
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ffb25907:

    # "Segismund" "Esto es una instalación de la Iglesia. Debería haber venido vestida correctamente."
    "Segismund" "This is a Church facility. You should have come dressed properly."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1065
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e71db278:

    # "Segismund" "No... así. En ninguno de los conventos que le proponemos la van a dejar vestir así."
    "Segismund" "Not... like that. In none of the convents we suggested, are they going to allow you to dress like that."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1066
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_0b96330f:

    # "Segismund" "No es... decoroso."
    "Segismund" "It's not... decorous."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1068
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e301dddb:

    # bet "Bueno, sobre eso es sobre lo que iba esta reunión, ¿no? Sobre esos conventos."
    bet "Well, that's what this meeting is about, isn't it? About those convents."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1070
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d1280e2b:

    # "Segismund" "Le he preparado la información que le prometí sobre los conventos disponibles."
    "Segismund" "I have prepared the information I promised you about the available convents."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1072
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_231bcd8a:

    # bet "No hace falta que me la de. No voy a aceptar ninguno de ellos."
    bet "You don't have to bother giving it to me. I'm not going to take any of them."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1074
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_89d3e1a6:

    # "Segismund" "¿Qué? ¿Por qué?"
    "Segismund" "What? Why?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1075
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_1f7e98ea:

    # "Segismund" "Eso significará la expulsión de la Iglesia. El obispo lo dejó muy claro."
    "Segismund" "That will mean expulsion from the Church. The bishop made that very clear."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1076
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_f057ccd6:

    # mc "*Risa*"
    mc "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1077
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_fa0e3ddb:

    # mc "¡Uy, perdón!"
    mc "Oops, sorry!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1079
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_4ac51a2f:

    # "Segismund" "¿De qué se ríe, muchacho?"
    "Segismund" "What are you laughing at, boy?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1080
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b1be1593:

    # mc "Una idea que me ha cruzado por la mente me ha parecido graciosa."
    mc "An idea that crossed my mind struck me as funny."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1081
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3d0c881d:

    # mc "No sé cómo funciona esto, pero si la despiden, la expulsan, o como se llame, ¿recibirá algún tipo de indemnización?"
    mc "I don't know how this works, but if she gets fired, expelled, or whatever it's called, will she get some kind of severance pay?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1083
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_c31dfe3d:

    # "Segismund" "No, por supuesto. La expulsión se debe a desobedecer órdenes del obispo."
    "Segismund" "No, of course not. The expulsion is due to disobeying orders from the bishop."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1084
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_dda5882e:

    # mc "Órdenes que, para cualquier persona que no pertenezca a la Iglesia, serían como una condena de cárcel o el exilio, ¿no?"
    mc "Orders that, for anyone not belonging to the Church, would be like a jail sentence or exile, no?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1086
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7ced21c0:

    # "Segismund" "No, Señor..."
    "Segismund" "No, Mr. ..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1087
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6a48c801:

    # mc "Marks. Soy el sobrino nieto de [bet]."
    mc "Marks. I am [bet]'s great-nephew."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1088
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_45506cc0:

    # "Segismund" "Como decía, está usted equivocado. Le estamos dando a su tía una oportunidad de seguir sirviendo a la iglesia y la está rechazando."
    "Segismund" "As I was saying, Mr. Marks, you are wrong. We are giving your aunt a chance to continue serving the church and she is rejecting it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1089
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_2fd99f3b:

    # "Segismund" "Todo es legal. La Iglesia siempre actúa de buena fe."
    "Segismund" "Everything is legal. The Church always acts in good faith."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1090
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_071bbae8:

    # mc "Entonces, no le importaría si yo fuera a la prensa y explicara la situación, ¿verdad?"
    mc "So, you wouldn't mind if I went to the press and explained the situation, would you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1091
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6ae2b90c:

    # mc "Si todo es legal y hecho de buena fe, no debería haber ningún problema."
    mc "If everything is legal and done in good faith, there should be no problem."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1092
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_872ad6ca:

    # mc "Tampoco en explicar lo que pasó en Tanzania, que es lo que nos ha traído a esta situación."
    mc "Nor in explaining what happened in Tanzania, which is what brought us to this situation."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1094
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_602e9eff:

    # "Segismund" "¡No puede hacer eso! Ayer acordamos con su tía que si hablaba con la prensa retiraríamos la oferta."
    "Segismund" "You can't do that! Yesterday, we agreed with your aunt that, if she talked to the press, we would withdraw our offer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1095
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_84d26f25:

    # mc "Y la expulsarían, ¿no?"
    mc "And you would expel her, wouldn't you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1096
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_963f1ff6:

    # mc "Si no acepta los conventos también la expulsarán, con lo que nada evita que vayamos a la prensa."
    mc "If she doesn't accept the convent suggestions, you'll also expel her, so nothing prevents us from going to the press."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1098
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7b4c3d17:

    # bet "[mc], déjalo. La decisión ya estaba tomada."
    bet "[mc], leave it be. The decision was already made."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1099
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_cd05795e:

    # mc "Déjame un momento, por favor."
    mc "Give me a moment to talk to Father Segismund, please."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1101
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_0733a41f:

    # mc "Entonces, una pequeña indemnización por los años de servicio sería lo idóneo y lo justo, ¿no?"
    mc "So, a small severance pay for the years of service would be fitting and fair, wouldn't it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1102
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_38e5141f:

    # "Segismund" "Eso no se ha hecho nunca. Sentaría un precedente."
    "Segismund" "That has never been done. It would set a precedent."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1103
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_beaa8c9e:

    # mc "Mire, no le estoy diciendo que compre nuestro silencio. Eso sería chantaje. Solo le estoy pidiendo lo que es justo para mi tía."
    mc "Look, I'm not telling you to buy our silence. That would be blackmail. I'm just asking you what's fair for my aunt."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1104
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_8be17c10:

    # mc "Ustedes la expulsan y ella tiene que empezar una vida nueva después de 40 años de servicio sin tener un dólar ahorrado."
    mc "You guys kick her out and she has to start a new life after 40 years of service, without a dollar saved."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1105
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_271ef249:

    # mc "No es justo, ¿no?"
    mc "It's not fair, is it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1107
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ca634ae9:

    # "Segismund" "No... pero... es legal."
    "Segismund" "No... but... it's legal."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1108
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_1abd3170:

    # mc "También es legal ir a la prensa a explicar la situación."
    mc "It's also legal to go to the press to explain the situation."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1109
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_eb986132:

    # mc "Podrán comprobar como descienden las donaciones cuando se descubra cómo trata esta diócesis a personas que han trabajado 40 años para la Iglesia."
    mc " You can watch donations go down when the donors find out how this diocese treats people who have worked for 40 years for the Church."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1111
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_435cc83a:

    # bet "¿Qué haces, [mc]?"
    bet "What are you doing, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1112
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_66fdf6fa:

    # mc "Tratar a la Iglesia como te ha intentado tratar a ti."
    mc "I'm doing exactly what the Church is trying to do to you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1113
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5210031e:

    # mc "Si ellos pueden usar sus armas, nosotros podemos usar las nuestras."
    mc "If they can use their tools, legal tools, we can use our weapons."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1114
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e157e17d:

    # mc "Supongo que no habían pensado que pudieras tener un sobrino abogado laboralista."
    mc "I guess they never thought you might have a nephew who's a labor lawyer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1116
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3b973a9c:

    # "Segismund" "¿Abogado laboralista? Entonces, ¿qué propone?"
    "Segismund" "Labor lawyer? What do you propose, then?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1117
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_0a5736cf:

    # mc "Una pequeña indemnización por cada año trabajado."
    mc "A small severance pay for each year she worked for you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1118
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3cf6aad0:

    # mc "No le estoy pidiendo que lo haga teniendo en cuenta el sueldo de un cirujano con los años de experiencia de mi tía."
    mc "I'm not asking you to do it using the salary of a surgeon with my aunt's years of experience."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1119
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_97335d6b:

    # mc "Puede usar su sueldo actual como referencia. Nos conformamos con 30 días de indemnización por año trabajado."
    mc "You can use her current salary as a baseline. We will settle for 30 days of severance pay per each year worked."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1120
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6f19be5d:

    # mc "No sé si, en alguno de los países en los que ha trabajado, la indemnización puede llegar a los 40 días por año trabajado. Lo tendría que mirar."
    mc "I don't know if, in any of the countries in which she worked, the indemnity can reach 40 days per year worked. I would have to look into it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1122
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_56cc5e5f:

    # "Segismund" "¡Eso sería mucho dinero! La Iglesia..."
    "Segismund" "That would be a lot of money! The Church..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1123
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_344c5410:

    # mc "La Iglesia va a perder mucho más en donaciones si esto sale en la prensa."
    mc "The Church is going to lose a lot more in donations if this gets out in the press."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1124
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b220ae06:

    # mc "Son poco más de tres años de sueldo de una monja. Lo acabo de calcular."
    mc "It's a little more than three years' salary for a nun. I just calculated it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1126
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d5a797ff:

    # "Segismund" "No puedo autorizar eso. No tengo poder para ello."
    "Segismund" "I cannot authorize that. I have no power for it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1127
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7e4db1e6:

    # "Segismund" "¿Podrían volver en un mes y les hacemos una propuesta?"
    "Segismund" "Could you come back in a month so we can present you with a proposal?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1128
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_fca52711:

    # mc "No."
    mc "No."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1130
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d31c8329:

    # bet "¿No?"
    bet "No?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1131
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_51d522b1:

    # mc "No, Tía [bet]. En un mes estaré fuera del país, y no quiero que te intenten estafar."
    mc "No, Aunt [bet]. In a month I'll be out of the country, and I don't want them to try to scam you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1133
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_29eb690c:

    # mc "Dice que no tiene poder para tomar esa decisión. Consúltelo con quién lo tenga que consultar y volveremos en tres horas."
    mc "You say you don't have the power to make that decision. Consult with whomever you need to consult with, and we'll get back to you in three hours."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1134
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_cd0aa0e1:

    # "Segismund" "¿Tres horas? No sé si tendré tiempo de..."
    "Segismund" "Three hours? I don't know if I'll have time to..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1135
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a3d0111e:

    # mc "Si en tres horas no tiene una propuesta, en tres días aparecerá en prensa nuestra versión de los hechos."
    mc "If you don't have a proposal within three hours, our version of events will appear in print in three days."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1136
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6fc27c56:

    # mc "Para que no puedan adelantarse y mentir, publicaré ahora mismo un twirp indicando el inicio de la historia."
    mc "So you can't get ahead of yourselves and lie, I'll post a twirp right now indicating the start of the story."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1137
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5eb435dd:

    # mc "Deme un segundo."
    mc "Give me a second, please."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1139
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_60f8d2ab:

    # "Después de publicar el twirp..."
    "After posting the twirp..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1140
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ec06f76b:

    # mc "Ya está hecho. La historia de una monja maltratada y chantajeada por la iglesia. En tres días sabrán toda la verdad."
    mc "It's done. The story of a nun mistreated and blackmailed by the church. In three days' time you will know the whole truth."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1141
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_0dee7c33:

    # mc "Nos vemos en tres horas. Tic-tac."
    mc "See you in three hours. Tick-tock."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1143
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ae9f9ed3:

    # mc "¿Nos vamos, Tía [bet]?"
    mc "Shall we go, Aunt [bet]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1144
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_24af5e07:

    # bet "Sí, vámonos. Creo que el Padre Segismund tiene unas llamadas que hacer."
    bet "Yes, let's go. I think Father Segismund has some calls to make."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1146
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_825c2221:

    # "Al salir del edificio de la Iglesia..."
    "On leaving the church building..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1147
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_eccb5103:

    # bet "¿Qué has hecho? Ya habíamos hablado de que venía a informarles de que dejaba de ser monja."
    bet "What happened there? We already discussed that I was coming to inform them that I was stopping being a nun."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1148
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5530c9aa:

    # mc "Vas a dejar de ser monja igualmente, no te van a permitir seguir en la Iglesia y moverte libremente. Pero te irás con los bolsillos llenos."
    mc "You're going to stop being a nun anyway, you're not going to be allowed to stay in the Church and move freely. But you'll leave with full pockets."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1149
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5c16c34c:

    # mc "Podrás pagar la certificación y ayudar a Meemaw con su nueva casa, tal como queréis las dos."
    mc "You'll be able to pay for the certification and help Meemaw with her new house, just like you both want."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1151
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_f72c981a:

    # bet "*Risa* Tienes razón. No se me hubiera ocurrido nunca."
    bet "*Laugh* You're right. I never would have thought of that."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1152
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7a807ac2:

    # mc "*Risa* Para eso me tienes a mí."
    mc "*Laugh* That's what you have me for."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1154
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_89b009df:

    # bet "Por cierto, creía que no mentías nunca."
    bet "By the way, I thought you never lied."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1155
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_4190fe76:

    # mc "Y no he mentido."
    mc "And I didn't lie."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1156
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_277eb0a0:

    # bet "¿Abogado laboralista? ¿Desde cuándo eres abogado?"
    bet "Labor lawyer? When did you become a lawyer?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1157
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_1502332f:

    # mc "Yo no he dicho que lo fuera. He dicho que ellos no podían imaginar que tuvieras un sobrino que lo fuera."
    mc "I didn't say I was. I said they couldn't imagine you having a nephew who was."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1158
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5c2166f5:

    # mc "Yo tampoco. *Risa* Porque no lo tienes."
    mc "Me neither. *Laugh* Because you don't have one."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1160
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b6d42a34:

    # bet "¿Y lo de las indemnizaciones de 40 días en los países en los que he trabajado?"
    bet "What about the 40-day severance pay in the countries I've worked in?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1161
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_57b7c2d1:

    # mc "He dicho que no sabía si alguno de esos países tenía 40 días de indemnización. *Risa*"
    mc "I said I didn't know if any of those countries had 40 days of severance. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1162
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_2a5f9b56:

    # mc "He pedido 30 días esperando que nos den 15. Lo de los 40 días de indemnización lo he dicho para ponerlo nervioso."
    mc " I asked for 30 days hoping they'll give us 15. The 40 days of severance I talked about was just to make him nervous."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1163
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ee19411c:

    # mc "Tanto él como tú habéis entendido lo que habéis creído oír, pero que yo no he dicho. *Risa* No hay una sola mentira en lo que he dicho."
    mc "Both he and you understood what you thought you heard, but which I did not say. *Laugh* There is not a single lie in what I said."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1165
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7af3c1c9:

    # bet "*Risa* A partir de ahora tendré que analizar todo lo que digas."
    bet "*Laugh* From now on I'll have to analyze everything you say."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1166
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_538d6a77:

    # mc "No hace falta. Esos trucos solo los uso con gente de fuera de la familia."
    mc "No need. I only use those tricks with people outside the family."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1167
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_87171caa:

    # mc "Con la familia tendrían un recorrido muy corto."
    mc "With the family, they would be short lived."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1168
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a08b775d:

    # mc "¿Vamos a buscar a [emm]? Tenemos tres horas para hacer turismo antes de tener que volver."
    mc "Are we going to get [emm]? We have three hours to go sightseeing before we have to go back."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1170
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_c73d7a39:

    # bet "Eso es otra cosa que no he entendido. ¿Por qué tres horas y no dos o cinco?"
    bet "That's another thing I didn't understand. Why three hours and not two or five?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1171
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5ae5607f:

    # mc "Sonaba bien lo de tres horas para arreglarlo o tres días para publicarlo."
    mc "It sounded good. Three hours to solve it or three days to publish it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1172
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e04d2764:

    # mc "Hoy es viernes, con el fin de semana por en medio, se publicaría el lunes. No tenían mucho tiempo para reaccionar."
    mc "Today is Friday, with the weekend in between, it would be published on Monday. They don't have a lot of time to react."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1173
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3f06bdb9:

    # mc "Además, a ese pobre hombre se le veía muy agobiado, como si no supiera de dónde le venían los golpes."
    mc "Also, that poor guy looked really overwhelmed, like he didn't know where the blows were coming from."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1174
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_0b5eb55b:

    # mc "Y lo del twirp ha sido lo que ha acabado de descolocarlo. Por suerte solo me sigue Jamaal en Twirper."
    mc "And the twirp thing is what really threw him off. Luckily, it's only Jamaal following me on Twirper."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1176
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e573a454:

    # bet "*Risa* ¿Y todo eso lo has pensado en un minuto?"
    bet "*Laugh* And did you think of all that on the spot?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1177
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ba1d33a2:

    # mc "No, ayer estuve pensando en diferentes escenarios, pero hasta que no ha dicho lo de la expulsión no he atado cabos."
    mc "No, I was thinking about different scenarios yesterday, but until he said the expulsion thing, I didn't connect the dots."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1178
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_27ccb0ee:

    # mc "En mi mente expulsión y despido venía a ser lo mismo, y he ido planeando cosas mientras hablaba."
    mc "In my mind, expulsion and firing came to be the same thing, and I planned the rest while talking."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1180
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_4cfa58a6:

    # bet "Pero les estás haciendo chantaje con lo de ir a la prensa. Podríamos acabar en la cárcel."
    bet "But you're blackmailing them about going to the press. We could end up in jail."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1181
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a710e820:

    # mc "No, no les estoy chantajeando. Son ellos los que intentaron chantajearte a ti diciendo que si ibas a la prensa retiraban su oferta."
    mc "No, I'm not blackmailing them. They are the ones who tried to blackmail you by saying if you went to the press they would withdraw their offer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1182
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ca7e35a8:

    # mc "Yo tan solo les he dicho que pueden retirar la oferta porque vamos a ir a la prensa igualmente."
    mc "I just told them they can withdraw their offer because we're going to go to press anyway."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1183
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_35aa0b2b:

    # mc "Si no quieren prensa, queremos un trato justo. Tan solo estamos rechazando su chantaje."
    mc "If they don't want the press poking its nose in church issues, we want a fair deal. We're just refusing their blackmail."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1185
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a06661e2:

    # bet "Y si intentaran denunciarnos, tendrían que reconocer que estaban intentando chantajearme."
    bet "And, if they tried to report us, they'd have to admit they were trying to blackmail me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1186
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a82b70fa:

    # mc "Exacto. No soy abogado, pero el cura tampoco lo es. El sentido común es lo que me dice, y supongo que a él también."
    mc "Exactly. I'm not a lawyer, but neither is the priest. The common sense is what tells me we are right, and I guess he felt the same, too."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1187
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_4c6701dc:

    # mc "Por eso le he dado poco tiempo para decidir. No va a poder consultar con mucha gente."
    mc "That's why I've given him little time to decide. He's not going to be able to consult with a lot of people."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1189
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_c944ee30:

    # bet "*Risa* Espero no tenerte nunca de enemigo."
    bet "*Laugh* I hope I never have you as an enemy."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1190
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b446b678:

    # mc "No deberías temerme a mí. *Risa* [ama] y [eva] te deberían preocupar más. Especialmente si no tienes un rodillo a mano."
    mc "You shouldn't be afraid of me. *Laugh* [ama] and [eva] should worry you more. Especially if you don't have a rolling pin at hand."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1191
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_2f33abec:

    # mc "Vamos a buscar a [emm] y a hacer un poco de turismo. Solo tenemos tres horas."
    mc "Let's go find [emm] and do some sightseeing. We only have three hours."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1193
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3e3e712e:

    # "Pasáis a buscar a [emm] por la heladería y le explicáis el resultado de la reunión."
    "You go meet [emm] at the ice cream parlor and explain the results of the meeting to her."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1194
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_eb17b87f:

    # emm "Menos mal que no he ido."
    emm "Thank goodness I didn't go."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1195
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b3961c59:

    # mc "¿Por qué?"
    mc "Why?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1196
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b2a91863:

    # emm "Lo primero que le hubiera dicho al cura hubiese sido 'Mi tía os abandona, gilipollas. Vosotros os lo perdéis.'"
    emm "The first thing I would have said to the priest would have been 'My aunt is abandoning you, assholes. It's your loss.'"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1197
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7ae3d058:

    # emm "Y no hubiera habido indemnización. *Risa* Además, no se me hubiera ocurrido nunca."
    emm "And there would have been no money. *Laugh* Besides, I would never have thought about asking for money."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1199
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7d2c8bc1:

    # bet "A mí tampoco. Pero [mc] ha pensado muy rápido y no ha dejado un segundo para que el Padre Segismund pudiera pararse a pensar."
    bet "Me neither. But [mc] spoke very quickly and didn't leave a second for Father Segismund to stop and think."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1200
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_8c2de467:

    # mc "Bueno, es una de las técnicas de negociación que me enseñaron en la universidad."
    mc "Well, it's one of the negotiation techniques they taught me at college."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1201
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_74514363:

    # mc "No la recomiendan por ser demasiado agresiva, y normalmente la gente tiene tiempo para pensar después, con lo que se dan cuenta de los fallos que haya cometido."
    mc "They don't recommend it because it's too aggressive, and people usually have time to think afterwards, so they realize any mistakes they've made."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1203
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_54844984:

    # emm "Lo importante es que está resuelto... a medias."
    emm "The important thing is that it's solved... halfway. We only need to wait for three hours."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1204
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_42ea4e89:

    # emm "¿Preparados para que os haga de guía turístico de Monterey?"
    emm "Ready for me to be your tour guide to Monterey?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1205
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_377e71a0:

    # mc "No sabía que habías estado aquí antes."
    mc "I didn't know that you had been here before."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1207
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_eddf0b65:

    # emm "No he estado nunca, pero he tenido tiempo de mirarme unas guías por internet mientras esperaba."
    emm "I've never been, but I had time to look at some guidebooks on the internet while I was waiting."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1209
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5e38cf5d:

    # emm "Y anoche, mientras alguien hacía otras cosas más divertidas."
    emm "And last night, while someone was doing other more fun things."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1210
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_ea8e8ae5:

    # mc "*Risa* Es un buen entrenamiento para ti. Querías ser fotógrafa de guías de viaje."
    mc "*Laugh* It's good training for you. You wanted to be a travel guide photographer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1212
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_aa056308:

    # bet "Nunca me has dicho como [eri] y tú decidisteis que vuestro sueño era algo tan específico y que coincidieseis en lo que queríais ser."
    bet "You never told me how [eri] and you decided that your dream was something so specific, and that you agreed on what you wanted to be."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1214
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_061db69d:

    # emm "Encontramos unas guías de Europa en la biblioteca del instituto, de esas viejas, en papel."
    emm "We found some guidebooks of Europe in the school library, the old paper ones."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1215
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5d5079a9:

    # emm "Venecia, París, Roma, Barcelona, Atenas..."
    emm "Venice, Paris, Rome, Barcelona, Athens..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1216
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_863ae883:

    # emm "Decidimos que queríamos conocer todas esas ciudades. *Risa* Y que no había mejor forma de hacerlo que si nos pagaban."
    emm "We decided that we wanted to visit all those cities. *Laugh* And that there was no better way to do it than if we got paid."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1217
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_45cf909a:

    # mc "El plan se le ocurrió a [eri], ¿no?"
    mc "It was [eri]'s plan, wasn't it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1219
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6f9ba524:

    # emm "¿Qué insinúas con eso? ¿Que mis planes no son realistas?"
    emm "What do you mean by that? Are you saying that my plans are unrealistic?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1221
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e228ff71:

    # emm "El de anoche funcionó."
    emm "Last night's one worked."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1222
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b84309d8:

    # mc "Pero se le ocurrió a [eri], ¿verdad?"
    mc "But it was [eri] who thought of it, right?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1224
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_08debe65:

    # emm "Sí. *Risa* Y vámonos a visitar Monterey o al final no podré enseñaros los sitios que he descubierto."
    emm "Yes. *Laugh* And let's go visit Monterey or I won't be able to show you the places I discovered."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1225
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d9a0c285:

    # mc "Vamos. Tenemos menos de tres horas."
    mc "Let's go. We have less than three hours."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1227
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_2f35927b:

    # "[emm] os lleva por algunos de los sitios más emblemáticos de Monterey, aprovechando para sacar fotografías en cada uno de ellos."
    "[emm] takes you to some of Monterey's most iconic sites, taking the opportunity to take pictures at each one."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1228
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a4dee4f8:

    # "Os da explicaciones sorprendentemente detalladas sobre cada uno de los lugares que visitáis."
     "She gives you surprisingly detailed explanations about each of the places you visit."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1229
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_bf6175b6:

    # "Pero esas tres horas se hacen muy cortas y tenéis que dejar muchas cosas en el tintero, para otra visita."
    "But those three hours go by very quickly and you have to leave a lot of things to be explored on another visit."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1230
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5706c58a:

    # "La última parada es la Catedral de Monterey, muy cerca del edificio donde os habéis reunido con el Padre Segismund."
    "The last stop is Monterey Cathedral, very close to the building where you met Father Segismund."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1231
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_c926f7ff:

    # emm "Y esta es la catedral más pequeña de los Estados Unidos. Se fundó como la capilla de un presidio español."
    emm "And this is the smallest cathedral in the United States. It was founded as the chapel of a Spanish presidio."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1232
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_77f2441d:

    # emm "Era como llamaban a sus fuertes."
    emm "That's what they called their forts."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1233
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_27596bdb:

    # bet "Muy interesante la visita, [emm]. Nos has dado un montón de información para haber estudiado la ciudad solo unas horas."
    bet "The visit was very interesting, [emm]. You have given us a lot of information for having studied the city for only a few hours."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1234
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6c389925:

    # mc "Si lo de hacerte fotógrafa no funciona, tienes futuro como guía turística."
    mc "If becoming a photographer doesn't work out, you have a future as a tour guide."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1236
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_6b6926e8:

    # emm "Iros antes de que me hagáis ruborizar. No estoy acostumbrada a los elogios."
    emm "Go away before you make me blush. I'm not used to compliments."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1237
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_c9198b76:

    # emm "Me llevo la camioneta a la heladería y os espero allí. Ya me estoy haciendo amiga de Margaret, la camarera."
    emm "I'm taking the truck to the ice cream parlor, and I'll wait for you there. I'm already becoming friends with Margaret, the waitress."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1238
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e57e09a3:

    # bet "Déjame un poco de helado. El dónut de antes me ha dejado con hambre."
    bet "Leave some ice cream for me. The doughnut I had earlier left me hungry."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1239
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_733dc6d8:

    # mc "Te vemos en un rato."
    mc "We'll see you in a bit."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1241
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_efd32a54:

    # bet "Hola de nuevo, Hermana. Venimos a ver al Padre Segismund de nuevo."
    bet "Hello again, Sister. We came to see Father Segismund again."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1242
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e9c67058:

    # "Monja" "Les está esperando. Pasen."
    "Nun" "He's waiting for you. Please, go in."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1244
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_61637fb9:

    # "Segismund" "Hola de nuevo. Tengo noticias para ustedes. Siéntense, por favor."
    "Segismund" "Hello again. I have some news for you. Please sit down."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1245
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_03495d72:

    # "Segismund" "He hablado con mis superiores y, por desgracia, no han aceptado lo de los 30 días de indemnización por año trabajado."
    "Segismund" "I talked to my superiors and, unfortunately, they did not accept the 30 days' severance pay per year worked."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1246
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_19bf6c02:

    # mc "Bueno, entonces no nos deja más opciones que ir a la prensa."
    mc "Well, then we have no choice but to go to the press."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1248
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d3db4a6b:

    # "Segismund" "No, espere. Me han autorizado a pagarle a la Hermana Beatrix tan solo 20 días de indemnización."
    "Segismund" "No, wait. But I have been authorized to pay Sister Beatrix 20 days' severance pay."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1249
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_f4c62f42:

    # "Segismund" "Usted tenía razón en que hay países en los que ha trabajado con indemnizaciones de hasta 45, pero otros tienen menos."
    "Segismund" "You were right that there are countries where she worked with severance pay of up to 45, but others have less."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1250
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_4911aef5:

    # "Segismund" "Sé que no era lo que esperaban, pero..."
    "Segismund" "I know it wasn't what you expected, but..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1251
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_dc7f482b:

    # mc "Entonces eso sería... algo más de dos años de sueldo."
    mc "So, that would be... a little over two years' salary."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1253
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_830701cc:

    # "Segismund" "Algo más. He pedido que, al no cumplir con sus peticiones, añadieran algo más por algunos complementos para su tía."
    "Segismund" "A bit more. I've asked that, as they didn't fulfill your requests, they add something additional for some extras for your aunt."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1254
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_61103e94:

    # "Segismund" "Al final, serán 2.34 años de sueldo. Lo siento pero no he podido conseguir más."
    "Segismund" "In the end, it will be 2.64 years' salary. I'm sorry but I couldn't get any more."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1255
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_0f58b44f:

    # "Segismund" "Obviamente tendrá que firmar un acuerdo de confidencialidad sobre todo este asunto."
    "Segismund" "Obviously, you will have to sign a non-disclosure agreement regarding this whole matter."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1256
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d093d5c0:

    # mc "2.34 años y acuerdo de confidencialidad. ¿Cómo lo ves, Tía [bet]?"
    mc "2.64 years and a non-disclosure agreement. What do you think, Aunt [bet]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1258
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3c013f7c:

    # bet "Me parece bien..."
    bet "Sounds good to me..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1260
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d957b91c:

    # mc "¿Hay oferta por escrito de todo esto?"
    mc "Is there a written offer for all this?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1261
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_56633b5c:

    # "Segismund" "Sí, también tengo el acuerdo de confidencialidad. Ha llegado todo hace unos minutos. Tres horas era muy poco tiempo."
    "Segismund" "Yes, I also have the non-disclosure agreement. Everything arrived a few minutes ago. Three hours was too little time."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1262
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5917cbbf:

    # "Segismund" "La oferta indica que dejará la Iglesia a final de mes, que es cuando se les entregará el dinero. Pero el acuerdo de confidencialidad entra en vigor hoy."
    "Segismund" "The offer states that she will leave the Church at the end of the month, which is when she will receive the money. But the confidentiality agreement takes effect today."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1263
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_987ab9f2:

    # mc "Me parece bien. ¿Firmamos?"
    mc "Sounds good to me. Shall we sign?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1265
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_e16f9f5e:

    # "Después de firmar todos los papeles..."
    "After signing all the papers..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1266
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_149060ab:

    # mc "Bueno, Tía [bet], en unos días dejarás de ser monja y tendrás una buena cantidad de dinero en tu cuenta."
    mc "Well, Aunt [bet], in a few days you will stop being a nun and you will have a good amount of money in your account."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1267
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_fa655e45:

    # bet "Sí. Creo que es lo mejor para todos. Para la Iglesia y para mí."
    bet "Yes. I think it's the best thing for everyone. For the Church and for me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1268
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_48ee1e2b:

    # mc "Creo que, ahora que todo está firmado, le puedes decir al Padre Segismund cuál era tu intención al entrar por esa puerta esta mañana."
    mc "I think that, now that everything is signed, you can tell Father Segismund what your intention was when you walked through that door this morning."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1270
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3938639c:

    # bet "¿Qué? ¿Crees que es necesario?"
    bet "Why? Do you think it's necessary?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1271
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_0f1781b4:

    # mc "Creo que vas a disfrutar cada segundo."
    mc "I think you're going to enjoy every second."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1273
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d1f08a29:

    # bet "Padre Segismund, primero quiero darle las gracias por hacer las gestiones tan rápido."
    bet "Father Segismund, first of all I want to thank you for taking care of everything so quickly."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1275
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5165c59d:

    # "Segismund" "Supongo que hay algún pero por lo que ha dicho su sobrino."
    "Segismund" "I suppose there is a 'but' coming because of what your nephew just said."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1277
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_97c571f0:

    # bet "Sí. Pero mi intención al venir hoy era abandonar la Iglesia. Nunca pensé en una indemnización ya que era yo la que me iba."
    bet "Yes. But my intention in coming today was to leave the Church. I never thought about any compensation since I was the one leaving."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1278
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_492795a5:

    # bet "Gracias por 2.34 años de mi sueldo."
    bet "Thanks for 2.64 years of my salary."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1280
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_7ed23dc3:

    # "Segismund" "¿Qué?"
    "Segismund" "What?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1281
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_f3acb3c7:

    # mc "*Risa* Por suerte, todo está firmado y mi tía ya no se puede echar atrás."
    mc "*Laugh* Luckily, everything is signed and neither you nor my aunt can no longer back out."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1282
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5cd145b7:

    # mc "Gracias por todo, Padre Segismund."
    mc "Thank you for everything, Father Segismund."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1283
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_d78cd553:

    # "Abandonáis el edificio de la Iglesia con la cara de sorpresa del Padre Segismund grabada en vuestras retinas."
    "You leave the Church building with Father Segismund's surprised face engraved on your retinas."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1285
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_b438befd:

    # "Una vez en el exterior..."
    "Once outside..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1286
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_3aa48686:

    # bet "Gracias por todo, [mc]. Si no hubiera sido por ti..."
    bet "Thanks for everything, [mc]. If it hadn't been for you..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1287
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5dc15e44:

    # mc "No tienes por qué darlas. He visto una oportunidad y la he aprovechado. Esperaba 15 días y nos han dado 20. No está mal."
    mc "You don't have to thank me. I saw an opportunity and I took it. I expected 15 days, and they gave us 20. Not bad."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1288
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a0116eca:

    # mc "Ahora tienes dinero suficiente para la recertificación, supongo."
    mc "Now you have enough money for recertification, I guess."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1291
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_a26a6a4e:

    # bet "Lo que más me jode de no haber dejado de ser monja hoy es que no te puedo besar ahora mismo aquí delante."
    bet "What really pisses me off about not having stopped being a nun today is that I can't kiss you right here, right now."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1292
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_f2817d0d:

    # bet "Serían capaces de excomulgarme para ahorrarse el dinero. *Risa*"
    bet "They could try to excommunicate me to save themselves all the money. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1293
translate english c24s002_BetNoNun_5c2c04f5:

    # mc "*Risa* Habrá mucho tiempo para eso. No te preocupes."
    mc "*Laugh* There'll be plenty of time for kisses. Don't worry."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1294
