# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1444
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_4f1d7478:

    # kia "Exacto. Ya he dejado la bolsa y el bolso en el coche."
    kia "Exactly. I've already left my bag and handbag in the car."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1445
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_03682c61:

    # mc "¿Bolsa? ¿Para qué necesitas una bolsa?"
    mc "Bag? Why do you need a bag?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1446
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_9171ef72:

    # kia "Esa es la segunda sorpresa de esta noche."
    kia "That's the second surprise of the evening."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1448
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_050a880b:

    # "[kia] conduce durante 20 minutos antes de aparcar el coche en lo que parece una viejo edificio."
    "[kia] drives for 20 minutes before parking the car near what looks like an old building."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1449
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_36c8bdc3:

    # "Por alguna razón, acabas cargando con su bolso."
    "For some reason, you end up carrying her handbag."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1451
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_5dc99045:

    # "Cuando entráis al restaurante está totalmente vacío. Es muy pronto para cenar."
    "When you enter the restaurant, it is completely empty. It´s too early for dinner."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1452
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_3220c059:

    # kia "Ya hemos llegado. Creo que no debes conocer este sitio. Lo abrieron mientras estabas en Portland."
    kia "We're here. I don't think you know this place. They opened it while you were in Portland."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1453
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_eb55958c:

    # kia "Y ninguna de las chicas lo conocía, con lo que seguramente no habrás venido nunca."
    kia "And none of the girls knew about it, so you probably haven't been here before."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1454
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_44e12ef9:

    # mc "No, no he venido nunca. No sabía ni que habían hecho un restaurante en este viejo almacén."
    mc "No, I've never been here before. I didn't even know they'd turned this old warehouse into a restaurant."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1456
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_e57afa09:

    # kia "Las fotos de internet parecían muy bonitas y le hacen justicia. Espero que te guste."
    kia "The pictures on the internet looked very nice and they didn't lie. I hope you like it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1457
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_e47f72b7:

    # mc "Me gustaría aunque fuera tu carrito de perritos calientes favorito."
    mc "I would like it even if it was your favorite hot dog cart."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1458
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_94812cb4:

    # mc "Me importa estar aquí contigo. Me da lo mismo dónde sea 'aquí'."
    mc "I care about being here with you. I don't care where 'here' is."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1459
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_3e238f06:

    # mc "Pero es pronto para cenar, ¿no?"
    mc "But it's too early for dinner, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1461
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_5c661d6f:

    # kia "Quiero acabar de cenar pronto para llevarte a un sitio."
    kia "I want to finish dinner early so I can take you somewhere else."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1462
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_5c4c9c2b:

    # mc "Eso suena interesante. ¿Es para ese sitio la bolsa?"
    mc "That sounds interesting. Is the bag for that site?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1463
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_91ddeff0:

    # kia "Sí, y no preguntes qué hay dentro."
    kia "Yes, and don't ask what's inside."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1464
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_b3621a01:

    # mc "*Risa* Estoy empezando a ponerme nervioso por esa sorpresa."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm starting to get nervous about that surprise."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1466
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_708aa274:

    # kia "No hace falta que te pongas nervioso. Es uno de mis lugares favoritos de Newport. E ir esta noche contigo me apetece mucho."
    kia "There's no need to be nervous. It's one of my favorite places in Newport. And I really want to take you there this evening."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1467
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_24fdb8f4:

    # mc "Entonces vamos a cenar. Casi tengo ganas de ir a ver tu sitio favorito."
    mc "Let's have dinner, then. I'm almost looking forward to finishing and going to see your favorite place."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1470
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_77bca2e2:

    # wai "Buenas noches, perdón por la espera. ¿Tenían reserva?"
    wai "Good evening, sorry for the waiting. We just opened. Did you have a reservation?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1471
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_9f4e6521:

    # kia "Sí, a nombre de [kia] Wellesley."
    kia "Yes, on behalf of [kia] Wellesley."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1472
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_5b089228:

    # wai "Sí, acompáñeme, por favor."
    wai "Yes, please come with me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1474
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_4c334347:

    # "La camarera os acompaña a la mesa y os entrega los menús."
    "The waitress accompanies you to the table and hands you the menus."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1475
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_8ca89980:

    # mc "¿Wellesley?"
    mc "Wellesley?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1476
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_e21185a8:

    # kia "Sí. No pienso usar nunca más el apellido Lamb, si puedo evitarlo. Quiero recuperar mi apellido de soltera."
    kia "Yes. I don't plan on using the surname Lamb ever again, if I can help it. I want to get my maiden name back."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1477
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_79b41575:

    # mc "Me parece una gran idea. Creo que brindaré por ello en cuanto nos traigan el vino."
    mc "I think that's a great idea. I think I'll toast to it as soon as they bring us the wine."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1479
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_47bed3e8:

    # kia "No voy a beber vino, [mc]. Hoy conduzco yo, y no quiero que la noche acabe con el coche de [mar] en la cuneta o nosotros detenidos."
    kia "I'm not going to drink wine, [mc]. I'm driving tonight, and I don't want the night to end with [mar]'s car in a ditch or with us arrested."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1480
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_8871f35d:

    # kia "Pero tú puedes beber si quieres."
    kia "But you can drink if you want."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1481
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_2af4c5b6:

    # mc "No me apetece beber si no lo haces tú pero, si quieres, podemos pedir mosto. Veo que tienen en la carta. No es lo mismo, pero..."
    mc "I don't feel like drinking if you don't, but if you want, we can order must. I see they have it on the menu. It's not the same, but ..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1483
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_1f8250a7:

    # kia "Nunca lo he probado. ¿Sabe a vino?"
    kia "Must? I never had it. Does it taste like wine?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1484
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_8aa61e12:

    # mc "No. *Risa* Es mucho más dulce. Básicamente es zumo de uva."
    mc "No. *Laugh* It's much sweeter. Basically, it's grape juice."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1485
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_8eccb780:

    # kia "*Risa* Entonces sí que lo he probado. Bebía mucho zumo de uva cuando era niña. Me gustaba. Y voy a cambiar la ensalada por filete."
    kia "*Laugh* Then I have tasted it. I drank a lot of grape juice when I was a child. I liked it. And I'm going to swap the salad for a steak. I'm hungry."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1486
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_b63d19d6:

    # mc "Entonces no se hable más. Zumo de uva y filete para la señora. Echaré de menos el aguacate."
    mc "Then let's not talk about it anymore. Grape juice and steak for the lady. I'll miss the avocado."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1487
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_514b4ad6:

    # "Miras la carta durante un momento."
    "You look at the menu for a moment."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1488
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_80a7d886:

    # mc "Y zumo de uva y pollo para mí."
    mc "And grape juice and chicken for me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1490
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_22e872b3:

    # "Después de que la camarera os tome nota..."
    "After the waitress takes your order..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1491
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_ec2f9a24:

    # kia "Llevo desde el día que comimos juntos queriendo salir a cenar contigo."
    kia "I've been wanting to have dinner with you since the day we had lunch together."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1492
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_9e42db99:

    # mc "Han sido unos días muy ocupados. Siento que no haya podido ser antes."
    mc "It's been a busy couple of days. I'm sorry it couldn't be sooner."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1493
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_5b3de040:

    # mc "¿Le has dicho a Geneviève que salimos a cenar? ¿Sigue pensando que me quiero aprovechar de ti?"
    mc "Did you tell Geneviève that we were going out for dinner? Does she still think I'm taking advantage of you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1495
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_89718c77:

    # kia "No, al menos no me ha dicho nada más. Cuando te fuiste se disculpó por meterse donde no le llamaban."
    kia "No, at least she didn't say anything else about you. When you left, she apologized for meddling where she shouldn't have."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1496
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_70432cf4:

    # kia "Pero no hemos vuelto a hablar de ti."
    kia "But we haven't talked about you again."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1497
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_a9d6a22b:

    # mc "Cuando me fui pensé que quizás había sido un poco duro con ella. Solo estaba intentando cuidar de ti. Protegerte."
    mc "When I left, I thought maybe I had been a little hard on her. She was just trying to look out for you. To protect you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1499
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_3e5fbbb7:

    # kia "Sus intenciones eran buenas, [mc], pero la forma de hacerlo no."
    kia "Her intentions were good, [mc], but the way she went about it, wasn't."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1500
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_7e77b0fb:

    # kia "No debería juzgarte sin conocerte. Y si te conociera..."
    kia "She shouldn't judge you without knowing you. And if she knew you..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1503
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_7ff36164:

    # kia "*Risa* Si no estuviera recién casada y enamorada de su marido, habría que hacerle un hueco en el harén."
    kia "*Laugh* If she wasn't a newlywed and in love with her husband, we'd have to make room for her in the harem."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1505
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_58c340bc:

    # kia "*Risa* Si no estuviera recién casada y enamorada de su marido, seguramente me pediría compartirte."
    kia "*Laugh* If she wasn't a newlywed and in love with her husband, she'd probably ask to share you with me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1506
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_4cb32db6:

    # kia "*Risa* Con lo que prefiero que no te conozca a fondo. Nos pasaríamos el día hablando de ti en la biblioteca."
    kia "*Laugh* So, I'd rather she didn't get to know you well. We'd spend all day talking about you in the library."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1507
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_5067e76e:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo dices como si las mujeres cayeran a mis pies a los cinco minutos de conocerme."
    mc "*Laugh* You say it as if women fall at my feet five minutes after meeting me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1509
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_e8271815:

    # kia "*Risa* Bueno, yo tardé cinco días viviendo en la misma casa. O en la de [nor] para ser más exactos."
    kia "*Laugh* Well, it took me five days living in the same house. Or in [nor]'s to be more exact."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1510
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_13e7e7dc:

    # mc "Tú me conocías de antes. Sabías cómo era."
    mc "You knew me before that. You knew what I was like."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1512
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_edcd5283:

    # "La camarera interrumpe vuestra conversación trayendo vuestro pedido. Continuáis en cuanto se va."
    "The waitress interrupts your conversation when she brings your order. You continue as soon as she leaves."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1513
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_489d1cf1:

    # kia "Aunque te conociera de antes, nunca me hubiera planteado estar aquí contigo."
    kia "Even if I knew you from before, I would never have considered being here with you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1514
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_ecaeda33:

    # kia "No, [mc]. No eres el mismo chico que conocí. Hay que ver el hombre en el que te has convertido para entender lo que siento."
    kia "No, [mc]. You're not the same boy I met. You have to see the man you've become to understand how I feel."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1515
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_b2516466:

    # mc "Gracias."
    mc "Thank you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1517
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_7fb94f8f:

    # kia "Y no solo me refiero a cómo eres conmigo o a las dos veces que te enfrentaste a Solomon."
    kia "And I'm not just talking about how you are with me or the two times you stood up to Solomon."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1518
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_4cfeb268:

    # kia "Cómo trataste al Decano para defender a [mar]. Cómo solucionaste el tema con el antiguo novio de [eri]."
    kia "How you treated the Dean to defend [mar]. How you solved the issue with [eri]'s ex-boyfriend."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1519
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_96302297:

    # kia "Cómo actuaste con el novio de la madre de [sca]. O cómo has solucionado lo de [bet]."
    kia "How you acted with [sca]'s mother's boyfriend. Or how you solved [bet]'s thing."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1521
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_949b0c0b:

    # kia "Todo eso no lo hace un chico. Son cosas que hace un hombre que toma las riendas cuando debe."
    kia "All that can't be done by a boy. It's done by a man who takes charge when he must."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1522
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_baea7e73:

    # mc "*Risa* Me vas a hacer ruborizar."
    mc "*Laugh* You're going to make me blush."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1523
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_31c784a3:

    # mc "No lo he hecho todo solo. [mar] ayudó mucho con el Decano. [eva] y [ama] con Solomon y Kevin..."
    mc "I didn't do it all alone. [mar] helped a lot with the Dean. [eva] and [ama] with Solomon and Kevin..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1525
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_a795c765:

    # kia "A eso me refiero. No sólo haces lo que tienes que hacer. Nos das ejemplo a las demás y nos inspiras para que nosotras hagamos lo que debemos."
    kia "That's what I mean. You don't just do what you have to do. You set an example for the rest of us and inspire us to do what we should."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1526
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_532f5c8b:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Joder, [kia]! Haces que parezca el líder de una secta."
    mc "*Laugh* Damn, [kia]! You make me look like the leader of a cult."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1528
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_cee6e392:

    # kia "Mas o menos. *Risa* Has creado una familia de elección a tu alrededor."
    kia "More or less. *Laugh* You've created a family of choice around you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1530
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_976b3965:

    # kia "Y no me refiero solo a las mujeres que estamos contigo. No eres el líder de esa familia. Pero eres el centro."
    kia "And I'm not just talking about the women who are with you. You're not the leader of the family. But you are at the center."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1532
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_fab6b4e0:

    # kia "Y aunque no seas el líder de esa familia, pero eres el centro..."
    kia "And even if you're not the leader of the family, you are at the center..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1533
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_14d6182a:

    # kia "Eres el factor común para todas nosotras. De [kat] a [mee], pasando por mí o por [mar]."
    kia "You are the common factor for all of us. From [kat] to [mee], passing through me or [mar]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1534
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_ef310305:

    # mc "¿[kat]? Ella ya iba a venir a casa antes de que yo volviera de la universidad."
    mc "[kat]? She was already going to come home before I got back from college."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1536
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_be7cdbc8:

    # kia "Sí, pero antes de que llegaran las chicas ya habías creado el ambiente que hay ahora."
    kia "Yes, but before the girls arrived you had already created the atmosphere that is there now."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1537
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_3424a685:

    # kia "Sólo con la familia cercana, pero suficiente para que fuera fácil que ellas se sumaran. Después nos hemos sumado el resto."
    kia "Only with the immediate family, but enough so that it was easy for them to join. Then the rest of us joined."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1538
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_e0583063:

    # mc "No hice nada de eso, [kia]. Me encanta que me veas así, pero no me puedo otorgar el mérito."
    mc "I didn't do any of that, [kia]. I love that you see me like that, but I can't take the credit."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1539
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_3391d298:

    # mc "Además, estamos hablando mucho de la familia y poco de nosotros."
    mc "Besides, we are talking a lot about the family and not enough about us."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1541
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_320e7130:

    # kia "Me da un poco de miedo hablar de nosotros. Hablar de ello lo hace demasiado real."
    kia "I'm a little scared to talk about us. Talking about it makes it too real."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1542
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_7987df6b:

    # mc "¿Es por Solomon? ¿Porque aún sigues casada con él?"
    mc "Is it because of Solomon? Because you're still married to him?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1544
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_eba57e1f:

    # kia "En parte sí. Pese a que soy católica, no soy de esas que rechaza el divorcio, pero él sí. Nunca me lo va a dar."
    kia "Partly yes. Even though I'm Catholic, I'm not one of those who rejects divorce, but he does. He's never going to grant it to me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1546
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_ecbea4c6:

    # kia "Y aunque me lo diera, tú y yo no nos vamos a poder casar nunca."
    kia "And even if he did, you and I will never be able to get married."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1547
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_44b2af23:

    # kia "No sería justo que sólo una de nosotras se pudiera casar contigo, con lo que lo hemos hablado entre nosotras y ninguna va a aceptar casarse contigo."
    kia "It wouldn't be fair if only one of us could marry you, so we talked it over and neither of us is going to agree to marry you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1549
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_a7ce1239:

    # kia "Y eso hace que tú y yo no nos vayamos a casar nunca."
    kia "And that means that you and I will never get married."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1550
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_18a88386:

    # mc "Se puede vivir una vida muy feliz sin estar casados, [kia]."
    mc "We can live a very happy life without being married, [kia]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1552
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_93e42b6c:

    # kia "Lo sé, pero me educaron para casarme con el hombre de mi vida. Creí que era Solomon y resultó no serlo."
    kia "I know, but I was raised to marry the man of my life. I thought it was Solomon, and it turned out not to be him."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1553
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_fd166dc8:

    # kia "Y si al final lo eres tú, no podremos hacerlo."
    kia "And if in the end it's you, we won't be able to marry."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1555
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_04a0ca8e:

    # kia "No voy a decir que me entristezca tener una relación contigo sin estar casados, pero..."
    kia "I'm not going to say that it saddens me to have a relationship with you without being married, but..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1556
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_8d55fe6c:

    # mc "Te entiendo. Pero tiene difícil solución."
    mc "I understand. But it's a difficult problem."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1557
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_d912836c:

    # kia "Lo sé. Pero hablemos de cosas más alegres."
    kia "I know. But let's talk about happier things."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1559
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_34ea56d4:

    # kia "[bet] me ha explicado lo que has hecho con la Iglesia en Monterey."
    kia "[bet] told me what you did with the Church in Monterey."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1560
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_6753da62:

    # mc "*Risa* Tenías que haber visto la cara del pobre cura al final."
    mc "*Laugh* You should have seen the poor priest's face at the end."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1561
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_a2e76ea8:

    # kia "Soy católica, pero no me gustan muchas de las cosas que hace la Iglesia."
    kia "I'm a Catholic, but I don't like many of the things the Church does."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1562
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_e94bfd37:

    # "Empiezas a explicarle cómo ha ido la reunión. Ella ya lo sabe porque se lo ha explicado [bet], pero te escucha atentamente."
    "You start to explain how the meeting went. She already knows because [bet] told her, but she listens to you attentively."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1563
