    mc "What?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1601
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_b22ca392:

    # kia "Hoy he entendido por primera vez a esas parejas. Me daba lo mismo que estuviéramos en público. Era como si sólo existiéramos tú y yo."
    kia "Today I understand those couples for the first time. I don't care if we are in public. It's as if there is only you and me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1602
translate english c24s003_KiaDate_a2ab25f7:

