    # kia "En los días buenos."
    kia "On the good days."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1688
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_fb61827f:

    # mc "Una vida de mierda que eligió él."
    mc "A shitty life that he chose."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1689
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_46f639b5:

    # kia "Sí, y que nos hacía pagar a [eil.nick] y a mí."
    kia "Yes, and that he made [eil.nick] and me pay for it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1691
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_1b5d6271:

    # kia "Pero a lo que iba... Cuando se iba a trabajar, no quería estar sola en casa. Me parecía opresiva."
    kia "But what I was getting at... When he left for work, I didn't want to be alone at home. It felt oppressive."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1692
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_d5176a34:

    # kia "Empecé a conducir sin rumbo fijo. Después de un par de días, empecé a buscar en internet sitios cerca de Newport donde no hubiera estado nunca."
    kia "I started driving aimlessly. After a couple of days, I started searching the internet for places near Newport where I had never been."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1693
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_b6967b68:

    # mc "Lo entiendo..."
    mc "I understand..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1695
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_5997eb17:

    # kia "Descubrí algunos sitios bonitos, pero ninguno como este. Se convirtió en mi lugar favorito."
    kia "I discovered some beautiful places, but none like this one. It became my favorite place."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1696
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_575229bd:

    # kia "Me daba... paz."
    kia "It gave me... peace."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1697
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_7ee7c847:

    # kia "Aquí me sentía segura. Sola pero segura."
    kia "I felt safe here. Alone but safe."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1699
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_87833168:

    # kia "Aquí nadie me decía que era una inútil ni me agarraba del pelo, llevándome por la casa para enseñarme lo que había hecho mal."
    kia "Here nobody told me I was useless... or grabbed me by my hair, dragging me around the house to show me what I had done wrong."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1701
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_6740bf72:

    # kia "Me podía imaginar navegando hacia la puesta de sol en un barco con [eil.nick]. Para no volver nunca."
    kia "I could imagine myself sailing into the sunset on a boat with [eil.nick]. Never to return."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1703
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_fb35d1b6:

    # kia "Sé que es una tontería. El sueño de un ama de casa infeliz."
    kia "I know it was silly. The dream of an unhappy housewife."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1704
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_b7bf6898:

    # kia "Pero me daba tranquilidad."
    kia "But it gave me peace of mind."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1705
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_b1600ea5:

    # mc "Lo entiendo, pero ¿por qué volver ahora que has dejado eso atrás?"
    mc "I understand, but why return now that you've left that behind?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1707
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_4fb7752b:

    # kia "Porque, aunque sea un sitio que evoca recuerdos oscuros, hace que los recuerdos felices que estamos creando se vean más brillantes."
    kia "Because, even though it's a place that evokes dark memories, it makes the happy experiences we're creating look brighter."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1708
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_8a3915a6:

    # kia "Y porque es un lugar precioso que quería compartir contigo."
    kia "And because it's a beautiful place that I wanted to share with you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1709
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_cd6b8591:

    # mc "Entonces deberíamos empezar a crear recuerdos felices aquí, ¿no?"
    mc "So we should start creating happy memories here, right?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1711
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_6dc0e356:

    # kia "Estar aquí hoy, contigo, ya es un recuerdo feliz, aunque lo esté viviendo ahora mismo."
    kia "Being here today, with you, is already a happy memory, even if I'm experiencing it right now."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1712
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_f93717c6:

    # mc "Pienso lo mismo. Pero me has prometido que habría besos aquí."
    mc "I think so too. But you promised me there would be kissing here."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1714
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_1e80552e:

    # kia "*Risa* Si empezamos a besarnos, nos perderemos la puesta de sol."
    kia "*Laugh* If we start kissing, we'll miss the sunset."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1715
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_9482bb51:

    # mc "Prefiero mirarte a ti que a la puesta de sol. Además, aún queda mucho."
    mc "I prefer to look at you than at the sunset. Besides, there is still time left until sunset."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1717
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_18249387:

    # kia "A mí me puedes mirar cuando quieras. La puesta de sol sólo dura un segundo."
    kia "You can look at me whenever you want. The sunset only lasts a second."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1718
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_477b69bf:

    # mc "Entonces déjame hacer algo antes de que se ponga el sol. Sé que puede parecerte una tontería."
    mc "Then let me do something before the sun goes down. I know it may seem foolish to you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1720
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_5d83a112:

    # kia "Ahora soy yo la que tiene curiosidad por lo que vas a hacer."
    kia "Now I'm the one who's curious about what you're going to do."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1721
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_e29a6b75:

    # mc "Antes has dicho que tú y yo no nos podríamos casar nunca. Porque Solomon nunca te dará el divorcio."
    mc "You said at the restaurant that you and I could never get married. Because Solomon will never grant you a divorce."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1724
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_5b9f333e:

    # mc "Y porque, aunque te lo diera, sería injusto que solo me casara contigo."
    mc "And because, even if he did grant it, it would be unfair for me to marry only you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1726
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_14df12c2:

    # mc "Y, aunque te lo diera, pasarían meses antes de que pudiéramos hacer algo así."
    mc "And even if he did grant it, it would be months before we could do something like that."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1727
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_8ea327c4:

    # kia "Sí. Pero lo entiendo, aunque me hubiera gustado si todo esto hubiera pasado en otras circunstancias."
    kia "Yes, although I would have liked it if all this had happened under different circumstances."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1729
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_c9956e94:

    # mc "Podemos crear nuestras propias circunstancias."
    mc "We can create our own circumstances."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1730
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_3952fb47:

    # kia "¿A qué te refieres?"
    kia "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1732
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_fdb6c9c3:

    # mc "[kia] Wellesley, ¿quieres casarte conmigo aunque nunca lo legalicemos?"
    mc "[kia] Wellesley, will you marry me even if we never make it legal?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1733
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_757bfbc7:

    # mc "Estaremos casados a nuestros ojos, aunque no lo estemos a los ojos del mundo."
    mc "We will be married in our eyes, even if we are not in the eyes of the world."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1734
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_adbf85c5:

    # kia "¿QUÉ?"
    kia "WHAT?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1735
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_56304b23:

    # kia "¿De dónde has sacado un anillo?"
    kia "Where did you get a ring from?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1736
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_a237cbdb:

    # mc "Del bolsillo..."
    mc "From my pocket..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1738
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_1da5a730:

    # kia "Me refiero... ¿Tenías esto planeado? ¿Has llevado un anillo todo este tiempo?"
    kia "I mean... Did you have this planned? Have you been carrying a ring all this time?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1739
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_e6ec41e7:

    # mc "No, cielo. Sé que es un muy cutre, pero lo he hecho con el estaño del tapón del mosto cuando has ido al lavabo."
    mc "No, honey. I know it's very cheesy, but I made it with the tin from the must cork when you went to the restroom."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1743
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_f35fd59b:

    # mc "Mis dedos han empezado a jugar con el metal y ha salido un anillo. Mi subconsciente me ha dicho que tenía que pedirte que te casaras conmigo."
    mc "My fingers started to fiddle with the metal and a ring came out. My subconscious told me that I had to ask you to marry me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1745
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_d4001fa4:

    # kia "¡Sí quiero!"
    kia "Yes! I do!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1746
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_8162835f:

    # mc "Te prometo cambiarlo por uno de verdad en cuanto pueda."
    mc "I promise to exchange it for a real one as soon as I can."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1748
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_c774bda3:

    # "Tu prometida se lanza a tus labios con una pasión desconocida hasta ese momento."
    "Your fiancée throws herself at your lips with a passion unknown until that moment."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1750
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_63ac09ce:

    # kia "Sí quiero. No te puedes imaginar lo bonito que es lo que acabas de hacer."
    kia "I do. I do. I do. You can't imagine how beautiful what you've just done is."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1751
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_d572b899:

    # mc "Sólo es un anillo hecho con el estaño de una botella..."
    mc "It's just a ring made from the tin from a bottle..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1752
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_b8fa6c64:

    # kia "No es el anillo. Es el hecho. Sabías que era importante para mí y lo has hecho."
    kia "It's not the ring. It's the deed. You knew it was important to me. And you did it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1755
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_7a750b76:

    # kia "Pero tengo que poner una condición."
    kia "But I have to put a condition."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1756
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_77c47ed2:

    # mc "¿Cuál?"
    mc "What one?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1757
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_ab2e544a:

    # kia "Que yo no sea la única a quién se lo pidas."
    kia "That I'm not the only one you ask."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1758
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_18f223f2:

    # mc "Me parece una condición que puedo cumplir."
    mc "It seems like a condition I can fulfill."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1759
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_3f179b78:

    # mc "Y vuelve a demostrar lo maravillosa que eres."
    mc "And it shows once again how wonderful you are."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1761
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_2e521197:

    # kia "¿Por qué?"
    kia "Why?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1762
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_8b4e3db9:

    # mc "Porque en un momento importante para ti, lo que haces es pensar en otras personas."
    mc "Because at an important moment for you, what you do is think of the other girls."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1763
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_0356e1ef:

    # kia "Es lo lógico, ¿no? Somos una familia..."
    kia "It's only logical, isn't it? We're a family..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1764
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_3672b52e:

    # mc "Sí, es lo lógico. Pero no todo el mundo lo haría en tus circunstancias."
    mc "Yes, it's logical. But not everyone would do it in your circumstances."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1766
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_b351e505:

    # mc "Lo que es importante para ti, es importante para mí."
    mc "What is important to you is important to me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1768
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_1c9399f7:

    # kia "¿Puedo volver a besar a mi prometido?"
    kia "Can I kiss my fiancé again?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1769
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_33974255:

    # mc "Por supuesto, pero... ¿y la puesta de sol?"
    mc "Of course, but... what about the sunset?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1770
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_b1b12e44:

    # kia "Ya la veremos otro día."
    kia "We'll see it another day."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1772
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_39520351:

    # "Os empezáis a besar como si no hubiera un mañana, como si el tiempo se hubiera paralizado y el sol no se fuera a poner nunca."
    "You start kissing as if there were no tomorrow, as if time had stopped and the sun would never set."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1773
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_7da5e73a:

    # "No eres capaz de saber cómo es posible que acabarais ese beso con la misma ropa que lo empezasteis."
    "You can't understand how you ended up kissing with the same clothes on that you started with."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1774
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_c1073a74:

    # "Tan solo recuerdas que fue uno de los besos más maravillosos de tu vida. Tu primer beso como prometido de alguien."
    "You just remember that it was one of the most wonderful kisses of your life. Your first kiss as someone's fiancé."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1775
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_fd099c8e:

    # "Y el sol se puso sin que os dierais cuenta."
    "And the sun set without either of you noticing it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:1776
translate english c24s003_KiaBeach_bef69e4a:

    # "Os da lo mismo."
    "And neither of you cared."

