    mc "We all have to accept the body we're dealt with, [sim]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2865
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_6e665169:

    # mc "Y a mí me gustan los vuestros. Los de las dos."
    mc "And I like yours. Both of them."

