    deb "We were just talking about swimming."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2893
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_179d63bb:

    # deb "Le estaba diciendo a [sim] que quizás pudiera convencer al entrenador de la universidad para que la dejara entrenar algunos días con nosotras."
    deb "I was telling [sim] that maybe I could convince the university coach to let her train with us on some days."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2894
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_0cb3e1bd:

    # mc "¿Puedes hacer eso?"
    mc "Can you do that?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2896
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_ea14bc84:

    # sim "¡Claro que puede! ¡Es la estrella de la universidad! Seguro que no le niegan nada."
    sim "Of course she can! She's the star of the university! I'm sure they won't deny her anything."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2898
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_1ce3d555:

    # sim "Pero prefiero que no lo haga. Sería como... no sé... probar cómo hubiera sido mi vida en otras circunstancias pero no poder vivirla del todo."
    sim "But I'd prefer she didn't. It would be like... I don't know... trying to imagine what my life would have been like in different circumstances but not being able to live it entirely."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2900
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_bf03d1c9:

    # deb "¡Es tan cabezota como su hermano!"
    deb "She's as stubborn as her brother!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2901
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_52bdc56e:

    # deb "Aprendería técnicas nuevas y cómo se entrena en la universidad. Sólo por eso ya valdría la pena."
    deb "She could learn new techniques and how university training works. For that alone, it would be worth it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2902
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_b8aabfc3:

