    sim "What?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2908
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_1c685b6d:

    # mc "Siempre te ha gustado nadar y ahora tienes que ver cómo otros lo hacen y esperar a que se ahoguen para salvarlos."
    mc "You always liked to swim and now you have to watch how others do it and wait for them to drown to save them."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2910
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_c2dd440a:

    # sim "*Risa* ¡No se ahoga nadie en mi guardia!"
    sim "*Laugh* Nobody drowns on my watch!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2911
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_e2a3c315:

    # mc "[sim], hablo en serio. Entiendo cómo te sientes, pero creo que deberías aceptar la oferta de [deb.nick]."
    mc "[sim], I'm serious. I understand how you feel, but I think you should accept [deb.nick]’s offer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2912
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_fb51b049:

    # mc "Entrenarías con las mejores de la ciudad y, aunque no vuelvas a competir, aprenderás muchísimo."
    mc "You would train with the best in town and, even if you never compete again, you would learn a lot."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2914
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_a9a18e0c:

    # deb "Es lo que le he dicho. Además, nuestro entrenador es muy bueno y aprenderá cómo entrenar a otros."
    deb "That's what I've been telling her. What's more, our coach is very good, and she'll learn how to train others."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2916
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_df1264f7:

    # deb "Es lo que querías estudiar, ¿no?"
    deb "That's what you wanted to study, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2918
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_142d4e09:

    # sim "Sí, pero sin la beca, no voy a ir nunca a la universidad. Dudo que nunca sea entrenadora."
    sim "Yes, but without the scholarship, I'm never going to go to college. I doubt I'll ever be a coach."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2919
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_cb3953ee:

    # sim "Y con mis récords, nunca voy a conseguir una beca."
    sim "And with my records, I'll never get a scholarship."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2920
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_f7506dbb:

    # mc "Pero aprenderás mucho igualmente. Y seguirás nadando, que es lo que importa."
    mc "But you'll learn a lot anyway. And you'll keep swimming, which is what matters."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2922
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_0f43e16d:

    # deb "Creo que no la vas a convencer. Como he dicho, es casi peor que intentar convencer a Jamaal para que suelte un plato de comida."
    deb "I don't think you're going to convince her. Like I said, it's almost worse than trying to convince Jamaal to let go of a plate of food."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2923
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_58e478ce:

    # mc "Siempre he dicho que se parecen mucho. No sé cuál de los dos es más terco."
    mc "I've always said they're very much alike. I don't know which of the two is more stubborn."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2925
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_9e085d60:

    # sim "¡Hey! Estoy aquí, ¿sabéis?"
    sim "Hey! I'm here, you know?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2926
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_188127f9:

    # "[deb.nick] y tú la ignoráis. Habéis encontrado su punto débil."
    "[deb.nick] and you ignore her. You've found her weak spot."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2928
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_30cf8c66:

    # deb "No creas que no la entiendo. Con esos dos flotadores tiene que ser incómodo nadar. En eso se diferencia de Jamaal."
    deb "Don't think I don't understand her. With those two buoys, it must be uncomfortable to swim. That's where she differs from Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2929
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_c021f347:

    # mc "*Risa* Sí, creo que Jamaal tiene poca flotabilidad con la silla de ruedas."
    mc "*Laugh* Yes, I think Jamaal has poor buoyancy in a wheelchair."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2930
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_31753902:

    # mc "Pero, ¿sabes en lo que sí que se parecen? A los dos les cuesta aceptar retos."
    mc "But do you know what they do have in common? They both find it hard to accept challenges."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2931
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_de0144ff:

    # mc "Jamaal tardó tiempo en descubrir que, aunque tuviera que vivir una vida diferente, podía hacer lo que le gustaba."
    mc "It took Jamaal a long time to discover that, even if he had to live a different life, he could do what he liked."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2933
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_903a7b4e:

    # sim "¡Tenía once años! ¡Era un niño!"
    sim "He was eleven! He was a child!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2934
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_866a67f9:

    # "Seguís ignorándola."
    "You keep ignoring her."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2936
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_f9147568:

    # deb "Y es una lástima que [sim] se comporte como una niña de once años, ¿verdad?"
    deb "And it's a shame that [sim] behaves like an eleven-year-old, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2937
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_a34fa9e3:

    # mc "Sí, una verdadera lástima. Va a dejar de hacer lo que le gusta porque no puede hacerlo al nivel que le gustaría."
    mc "Yes, a real shame. She's going to stop doing what she likes because she can't do it at the level she'd like to."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2938
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_ce1a8e38:

    # deb "*Risa* Justo como su hermano." (multiple=2)
    deb "*Laugh* Just like her brother." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2939
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_c7beffad:

    # mc "*Risa* Justo como Jamaal." (multiple=2)
    mc "*Laugh* Just like Jamaal." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2940
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_def7e49a:

    # mc "¿Sabes que Jam estuvo a punto de no ir al baile de graduación?"
    mc "Do you know that Jam almost didn't go to the prom?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2942
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_28bc3de6:

    # sim "¡Porque le dejó su novio dos semanas antes del baile!"
    sim "Because his boyfriend dumped him two weeks before the prom!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2944
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_fad15be1:

    # "[deb.nick] continúa como si no hubiera escuchado nada."
    "[deb.nick] continues as if she hadn't heard anything."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2945
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_14558884:

    # deb "¿Porque no podía bailar?"
    deb "Because he couldn't dance?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2946
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_78320f97:

    # mc "No, le encanta bailar y hace unas cosas tremendas con las ruedas. Pero no quería porque no podía bailar con quién él hubiera querido bailar."
    mc "No, he loves dancing, and he does some amazing things with those wheels. But he didn't want to go because he couldn't dance with whoever he would have wanted to dance with."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2947
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_bd261694:

    # mc "Es como su hermana. Ella no quiere nadar porque no puede nadar en competiciones."
    mc "He's like his sister. She doesn't want to swim because she can't swim competitively."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2948
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_befe1427:

    # mc "Yo convencí a Jam, pero te tocará a ti convencer a [sim]."
    mc "I convinced Jam, but it's up to you to convince [sim]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2950
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_1039aabf:

    # sim "¡Parad! ¡Vale! ¡Habla con ese entrenador a ver si puedo entrenar con vosotras alguna tarde este verano!"
    sim "Stop! Okay! Talk to that coach and see if I can train with you some afternoons this summer!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2951
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_8821a64c:

    # mc "¡Oh, [sim]! ¿Estabas aquí?"
    mc "Oh, [sim]! Were you here?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2952
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_46eb31ff:

    # sim "*Grrrr*"
    sim "*Grrrr*"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2954
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_ebd8990d:

    # deb "*Risa* Si lo hubiéramos planeado no hubiera podido salir mejor."
    deb "*Laugh* If we had planned it, it couldn't have gone better."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2955
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_a52d9d69:

    # mc "*Risa* Pero es una táctica que siempre funciona con los Washington. Comparar a [sim] y a Jamaal."
    mc "*Laugh* But it's a tactic that always works with the Washingtons. Comparing [sim] and Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2957
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_721bf2a3:

    # sim "Pues ahora te vamos a expulsar de la piscina."
    sim "Well, now we're going to kick you out of the pool."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2958
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_5a242d9e:

    # mc "¿Por qué a mí? ¡Lo hemos hecho [deb.nick] y yo!"
    mc "Why me? [deb.nick] and I did it together!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:2960
translate english c24s004_Deb_Sim_2e27a1e4:

    # sim "Puedes ir a la otra zona. Esto se acaba de convertir en Zona de Entrenamiento [sim]. Vamos a ponernos bañadores para entrenar. ¡No se puede entrenar en bikini!"
    sim "You can go to the other zone. This has just become The [sim] Training Zone. Let's put on our swimsuits to train. We can't train in a bikini!"

