    mcp "(And you would help her understand that being tall can have many advantages.)"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3049
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_fec9e41f:

    # mcp "(Y que no me gusta sólo a mí que sea así.)"
    mcp "(And it's not just me who likes her that way.)"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3050
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_9cf0af5b:

    # mc "Supongo que diferentes vestidos quedarán mejor o peor en diferentes modelos."
    mc "I guess that different dresses will look better or worse on different models."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3052
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_b12266cc:

    # emm "*Risa* Y si haces un vestido rosa, yo me presto voluntaria para posar con él."
    emm "*Laugh* If you make a pink dress, I volunteer to model it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3053
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_980c43f9:

