    mad "There are some dresses that would look great in romantic poses with a man."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3067
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_5b721e88:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Quieres que haga de modelo para ti? Por mí no hay ningún problema."
    mc "*Laugh* Do you want me to model for you? No problem."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3069
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_d085e527:

    # emm "*Risa* Podrías hacer del madurito cuarentón seduciendo a una jovencita. Ya sabes que aparentas más edad de la que tienes."
    emm "*Laugh* You could play the forty-something mature guy seducing a young girl. You know you look older than you are."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3071
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_c553849f:

    # mc "*Risa* Contigo funcionó, aunque no tuviera que hacer nada para seducirte."
    mc "*Laugh* It worked with you, even though I didn't have to do anything to seduce you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3073
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_ab9a09cf:

