    mad "*Laugh* You know I hate you sometimes, right?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3080
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_b3961c59:

    # mc "¿Por qué?"
    mc "Why?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3082
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_801f217c:

    # mad "Es una tontería pero, excepto el cumpleaños de las chicas, me he perdido todas las actividades familiares."
    mad "It's silly but, except for the girls’ birthday, I missed all the family activities."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3083
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_b40dc845:

    # mad "La fiesta en la playa, la noche en el club de Jazz... A veces os ponéis a hablar de esas cosas y estoy un poco fuera de lugar."
    mad "The party on the beach, the night at the jazz club... Sometimes you start talking about those things and I feel a bit out of place."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3084
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_a2ed892b:

    # mad "Me hubiera gustado estar, pero hasta la partida de DnD no me sentía parte de esto..."
    mad "I would have liked to have been there, but until the DnD game I didn't feel part of this..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3086
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_89c7a297:

    # emm "No te preocupes, [mad.nick]. A partir de ahora vendrás siempre que hagamos algo especial."
    emm "Don't worry, [mad.nick]. From now on you'll come whenever we do something special."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3087
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_c4691a62:

    # emm "Estoy pensando que, si tú te sientes así, ¿cómo se van a sentir las chicas que llegan en Septiembre?"
    emm "I'm thinking that, if you feel that way, how are the girls who arrive in September going to feel?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3088
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_ea950fdc:

    # mc "Bueno, falta por ver si se integran en la familia tan rápido como..."
    mc "Well, it remains to be seen if they integrate into the family as quickly as..."

