translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_13336c01:

    # lis "¿Como nosotras? Estoy segura de que lo harán. [sca] me dijo que una de ellas era amiga suya y de [dap] hace años, que vivía en Newport."
    lis "As quickly as us? I'm sure they will. [sca] told me that one of them has been friends with her and [dap] for years, that she lived in Newport years ago."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3091
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_d2bfd7da:

    # lis "Integrarla a ella en la familia será fácil, y a la prima de [sai] también."
    lis "Integrating her into the family will be easy. And [sai]’s cousin too."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3092
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_73e1891a:

    # mc "¿Quién es la amiga de [dap] y [sca]?"
    mc "Who is [dap] and [sca]’s friend?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3094
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_2006bb97:

    # emm "Patty. No sé si la recuerdas, morena, ojos grandes... era un par de días mayor que [sca]. No era muy amiga mía, pero nos llevábamos bien."
    emm "Patty. I don't know if you remember her, black hair, big eyes... she was a week older than [sca]. She wasn't really my friend, but we got on well."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3095
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_c6e65843:

    # emm "Su madre encontró trabajo en Dallas, y se marcharon un año antes de que tú te graduaras."
    emm "Her mother found work in Dallas, and they left a year before you graduated."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3096
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_9735c5af:

    # mc "Me suena el nombre, pero no le puedo poner cara."
    mc "I recognize the name, but I can't put a face to it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3097
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_361c0599:

    # emm "Deberías mirar los expedientes de las chicas nuevas y..."
    emm "You should look at the files of the new girls and..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3099
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_7e4f81b9:

    # kim "[mad.nick], ¿me puedes ayudar a...?"
    kim "[mad.nick], can you help me with...?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3101
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_1b793e18:

    # kim "¡Oops! Veo que estáis ocupadas. No os preocupéis."
    kim "Oops! I see you're busy. Don't worry."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3103
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_92ebf9da:

    # kim "Voy a pedirle ayuda a la Abuela..."
    kim "I'm going to ask Grandma for help..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3105
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_0cf2d20b:

    # mc "¿Qué le pasa?"
    mc "What's up with [kim]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3106
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_1312c559:

    # emm "¿No la has oído? Ha visto que [mad.nick] está ocupada y..."
    emm "Didn't you hear her? She saw that [mad.nick] was busy and..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3107
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_4c912813:

    # mad "... Y no ha querido entretenerme por si..."
    mad "... And she didn't want to distract me in case..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3108
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_ae12de5d:

    # lis "... Por si estaba haciendo algo importante... supongo..."
    lis "... In case she was doing something important... I guess..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3109
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_8fb9d37f:

    # mc "¿Qué me estáis ocultando, chicas?"
    mc "What are you girls hiding from me?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3111
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_82af4742:

    # lis "¿Nosotras?"
    lis "Us?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3112
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_54273a9a:

    # emm "¿Qué íbamos a querer ocultarte?"
    emm "What could we possibly want to hide from you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3113
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_c88f9707:

    # mad "Si es algo en lo que puede ayudarle Olivia..."
    mad "If it's something [mee] can help her with..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3114
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_926339a4:

    # mc "Vale, no os voy a sacar nada, ¿verdad?"
    mc "Okay, I'm not going to get anything out of you, am I?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3116
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_358c1155:

    # "Todas" "Nope."
    "All of them" "Nope."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3117
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_0d14768e:

    # lis "Además, lo dices como si... en el caso de que le pasara algo a [kim]... nosotras supiéramos qué es."
    lis "Besides, you say it as if... in case something happened to [kim]... we would know what it was."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3118
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_e6e01b5f:

    # emm "Y no estamos diciendo que le pase nada..."
    emm "And we're not saying anything happened to her..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3119
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_64443da5:

    # mad "Ni que sepamos qué le pasa... si es que le pasa algo. O que te lo fuéramos a decir si lo supiéramos."
    mad "Nor that we know what's wrong with her... if there's anything wrong with her. Or that we would tell you if we knew."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3120
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_6245c0df:

    # mc "*Risa* Vale, vale. Pero... ¿ha llamado 'Abuela' a Meemaw?"
    mc "*Laugh* Okay, okay. But... did she call Meemaw 'Grandma'?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3122
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_d2f469c8:

    # emm "*Risa* Sí. [kim] está llevando lo de integrarse en la familia a un nuevo nivel. Pero aún no se atreve a llamárselo a ella."
    emm "*Laugh* Yes. [kim] is taking the whole integrating into the family thing to a new level. But she still doesn't dare say it in front of her."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3123
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_07cfc36c:

    # lis "*Risa* El día menos pensado nos empieza a llamar hermanas a todas."
    lis "*Laugh* One of these days she'll start calling us all sisters."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3124
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_d9c03e82:

    # mad "*Risa* No dejaría de ser divertido que tantas chicas de razas diferentes nos empezásemos a considerar hermanas algún día."
    mad "*Laugh* It would be funny if so many girls of different races started to consider us sisters one day."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3125
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_e2655347:

    # "En ese momento oís una furgoneta y cómo se abre la verja de entrada."
    "At that moment you hear a van and the entrance gate opening."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3127
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_d4ec7df7:

    # emm "Creo que esa es [ama]. Debe venir a buscarte para lo de esta noche."
    emm "I think that's [ama]. She must be coming to pick you up for this evening's event."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3128
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_36dfb3ee:

    # mc "Pero es muy pronto para que venga el helicóptero."
    mc "But it's too early for the helicopter to come."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3129
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_43266a7a:

    # emm "A lo mejor quiere repasar algunos datos."
    emm "Maybe she wants to review some data."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3130
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_605d1430:

    # mc "Voy a ver..."
    mc "I'll go and see..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3139
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_66e9c8c2:

    # "Te despides de las chicas y te diriges a la furgoneta."
    "You say goodbye to the girls and head for the van."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3141
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_7a8239e6:

    # "[ama] está sentada dentro, parece que está escribiendo algo."
    "[ama] is sitting inside, she seems to be writing something."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3143
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_d9be006a:

    # "Te acercas a la furgoneta, dispuesto a golpear en la ventanilla."
    "You approach the van, ready to knock on the window."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3144
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_4671c751:

    # ama "Un momento, [mc], por favor."
    ama "One moment, [mc], please."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3145
translate english c24s004_Mad_Lis_Emm_f63377ab:

    # "Esperas."
    "You wait."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3149
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_1657ce25:

    # "Unos minutos antes, en la cocina de [nor]..."
    "A few minutes earlier, at [nor]'s kitchen..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3150
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_c653479e:

    # mee "Un día tengo que ir a oírte cantar. Siempre me ha gustado el jazz."
    mee "One day I have to go and hear you sing. I've always liked jazz."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3151
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_af457e4a:

    # meg "Aunque el sitio se llame Jazz Corner, no solo canto jazz. Tenemos un repertorio muy variado."
    meg "Although the place is called Jazz Corner, I don't only sing jazz. We have a varied repertoire."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3153
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_3af7fb04:

    # mee "Bueno, igualmente me gustaría ir. Hace años que no voy a ningún sitio con música en directo."
    mee "Well, I'd still like to go. It's been years since I've been anywhere with live music."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3155
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_ff447e67:

    # meg "¿Ibas mucho cuando...?"
    meg "Did you go a lot when...?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3157
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_1dfbe6a8:

    # mee "*Risa* ¿Cuando era joven?"
    mee "*Laugh* When I was young?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3158
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_441cb2fd:

    # mee "Sí, a John y a mí nos gustaba mucho ir, especialmente antes de casarnos, cuando él aún vivía en San Francisco."
    mee "Yes, John and I used to love going, especially before we were married, when he was still living in San Francisco."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3160
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_ee6c2dee:

    # meg "San Francisco siempre ha tenido buenos clubes de jazz. ¿Teníais algún favorito?"
    meg "San Francisco always had good jazz clubs. Did you have a favorite?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3162
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_19267300:

    # mee "Sí, el Keystone Korner. Un clásico. Incluso estuvimos allí en un par de ocasiones cuando hicieron grabaciones de directos."
    mee "Yes, the Keystone Korner. A classic. We even went there a couple of times when they did live recordings."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3163
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_fee7d91a:

    # mee "Todavía tengo los vinilos de esas grabaciones."
    mee "I still have the LPs of those recordings."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3165
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_add89710:

    # meg "¡Oh! ¡Eso es increíble! ¿De quién son los discos?"
    meg "Oh! That's incredible! Who are the records by?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3167
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_050b1da4:

    # mee "Uno es de Tete Montoliu y otro de Jaki Byard, los dos en el '79 o el '80. Son fantásticos."
    mee "One is by Tete Montoliu, and the other is by Jaki Byard, both in '79 or '80. They're fantastic."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3169
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_90e7cdda:

    # meg "¡Me tienes que dejar escucharlos!"
    meg "You have to let me listen to them!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3170
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_c08e7e22:

    # meg "Me das mucha envidia. ¡Estuviste ahí cuando se escribía historia de la música!"
    meg "I'm so jealous. You were there when music history was being written!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3172
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_db86b5aa:

    # mee "Bueno, eran otros tiempos. Todo era más artesanal."
    mee "Well, those were different times. Everything was more artisanal."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3173
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_5a09e21b:

    # mee "Los tengo en la casa de Florida. Te los traeré cuando vaya la semana que viene a poner la casa en venta."
    mee "I have those LPs in Florida. I'll bring them back with me when I go next week to put the house up for sale."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3175
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_efa5a653:

    # meg "Explícame cosas de aquella época, por favor. Es una de mis épocas favoritas de la música."
    meg "Can you tell me more about that era, please? It's one of my favorite eras in music."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3177
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_a17d78ab:

    # "Las dos mujeres se enzarzan en una conversación sobre una época pasada de clubs de música donde pasaban cosas importantes."
    "The two women engage in a conversation about a bygone era of music clubs where important things happened."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3178
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_8015d8a9:

    # "Un tiempo en el que podías coincidir con músicos famosos en clubs que no estaban abarrotados."
    "A time when you could meet famous musicians in clubs that weren't crowded."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3180
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_96cd1768:

    # kim "Hola, [mee]. ¿Qué hay, [meg]?"
    kim "Hi, [mee]. What's up, [meg]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3181
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_acb33e75:

    # kim "¿Puedo pedirte un favor, [mee]?"
    kim "Can I ask you a favor, [mee]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3183
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_566154d1:

    # mee "Lo que quieras, cielo."
    mee "Anything, sweetheart."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3184
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_f494511a:

    # meg "¿Qué pasa, [kim]?"
    meg "What's up, [kim]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3186
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_37bf481f:

    # kim "Al ponerme el uniforme para esta noche lo he roto. Me va un poco apretado..."
    kim "I tore my uniform when I tried it on earlier. It's a bit tight..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3187
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_551c25ce:

    # kim "He intentado coserlo, pero... estoy muy nerviosa y soy incapaz de enhebrar la aguja."
    kim "I tried to sew it, but... I'm too nervous, and I can't thread a needle."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3189
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_af0836b9:

    # mee "Dame ese uniforme. Deja que la abuela haga su magia con la aguja."
    mee "Give me the uniform. Let Grandma work her magic with the needle."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3190
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_b57a3de6:

    # mee "¿Hay hilo y aguja en esa bolsa? Siéntate mientras lo coso."
    mee "Is there a needle and thread in that bag? Sit down while I sew it up."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3192
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_41d397cb:

    # "Unos minutos después..."
    "A few minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3193
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_330d4fd8:

    # mee "Ya está cosido. He reforzado alguna de las costuras que parecían más débiles."
    mee "Fixed. I've reinforced some of the seams that looked the weakest."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3194
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_29f1f78b:

    # mee "Ese uniforme estaba muy mal cosido."
    mee "That uniform was very poorly sewn."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3196
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_b8c3d049:

    # kim "Gracias, [mee]. No sé qué habría hecho sin ti. Voy a probármelo a ver si no rompo nada esta vez."
    kim "Thanks, [mee]. I don't know what I would have done without you. I'm going to try it on to make sure I don't tear anything again."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3198
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_c1aba282:

    # meg "Pruébatelo en el baño si quieres y así te lo vemos puesto."
    meg "Try it on in the bathroom if you want and we'll see how it looks on you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3199
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_5dabd8a1:

    # meg "Y [mee] puede repararlo si se rompe alguna otra costura."
    meg "And [mee] can fix it if any other seams tear."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3201
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_7c4a90bf:

    # mee "O puedes subir a mi habitación si quieres. O incluso cambiarte aquí."
    mee "Or you can go up to my room if you want. Or even change here."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3202
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_7741ec41:

    # mee "*Risa* Esta cocina ya ha visto a mucha gente desnuda últimamente."
    mee "*Laugh* This kitchen has seen a lot of nudity lately."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3204
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_fcd06ab9:

    # meg "¿A quién? Creía que la zona nudista era solo en el jacuzzi."
    meg "Who? I thought the only nudist area was the jacuzzi."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3206
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_71aa2cba:

    # kim "Oí que [mc] se había desnudado aquí para poner fin a una discusión sobre la desnudez el día del secuestro."
    kim "I heard that [mc] got naked here to end an argument about nudity on the day of the kidnapping."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3207
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_393174ef:

    # kim "A veces tiene unos métodos... extraños..."
    kim "He uses some... strange... methods, sometimes."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3208
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_d05e16a5:

    # kim "Dame la bolsa. [mc] está ocupado en la piscina y el resto somos todas chicas. Voy a cambiarme en ese rincón."
    kim "Give me the bag. [mc] is busy by the pool and the rest of us are all girls. I'm going to change in that corner."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3210
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_0c47b986:

    # meg "¿Es eso cierto? ¿[mc] se desnudó durante el secuestro?"
    meg "Is that true? [mc] got naked during the kidnapping?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3212
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_9c24b532:

    # mee "*Risa* No, [mc] lo hizo después del secuestro. Me estaba comportando como una idiota y me puso en mi sitio."
    mee "*Laugh* No, [mc] did it after the kidnapping. I was behaving like an idiot and he put me in my place."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3213
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_e869658b:

    # mee "*Risa* La que se desnudó durante el secuestro fui yo. O más bien, ya estaba desnuda pero dejé caer la toalla."
    mee "*Laugh* I was the one who got naked during the kidnapping. Or rather, I was already naked, but I dropped the towel."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3215
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_ce6e31d7:

    # kim "Tía [bet] me lo contó. Fuiste muy valiente y sirvió para que los secuestradores se despistaran y [eva] pudiera entrar."
    kim "Aunt [bet] told me about it. You were very brave, and it helped the kidnappers to lose focus and [eva] was able to intervene."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3217
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_5881d1d8:

    # meg "¡Esperad! Había oído lo del secuestro, pero no me había enterado de nada de eso..."
    meg "Wait! I had heard about the kidnapping, but I didn't know any of that..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3218
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_0e4a078c:

    # meg "¡Me lo tenéis que explicar todo!"
    meg "You'll have to explain everything to me!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3220
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_435c2cc6:

    # "Mientras [mee] pone en antecedentes a [meg], [kim] se prueba el uniforme para el evento de la noche."
    "While [mee] fills in [meg], [kim] tries on her uniform for the evening event."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3223
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_04f6548a:

    # kim "¡Ha quedado genial, [mee]! ¡Muchas gracias!"
    kim "It looks great, [mee]! Thank you so much!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3225
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_43720c20:

    # meg "¡Estás monísima con ese uniforme!"
    meg "You look so cute in that uniform!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3226
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_c1f18785:

    # mee "Es super gracioso. Pareces salida de una película de Corea o Vietnam, cuando las actrices y cantantes se vestían de militares para apoyar a las tropas."
    mee "You're so adorable. You look like you're straight out of a Korean or Vietnam war movie, when actresses and singers dressed as soldiers to support our troops."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3228
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_fefc7116:

    # kim "La verdad es que es muy chulo. Tengo ganas de hacer este evento. El yate es increíble."
    kim "It's really cool. I can't wait for this event. The yacht is amazing."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3230
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_ca9e7bac:

    # kim "Ahora solo necesito llamar a un Under para que me lleve a Westport."
    kim "Now I just need to call an Under to take me to Westport."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3232
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_d27e5cac:

    # meg "¿Dónde de Westport tienes que ir y a qué hora tienes que estar?"
    meg "Where in Westport do you have to go and what time do you have to be there?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3233
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_ef69494f:

    # meg "Te podría llevar yo antes de ir al club."
    meg "I could take you there before going to the club."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3235
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_75c4ea81:

    # "Las tres mujeres pasan un rato hablando sobre el trabajo de [kim] y geografía de Westport."
    "The three women spend some time talking about [kim]'s work and the geography of Westport."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3236
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_04244bf3:

    # "También hablan de la familia y de los planes que tiene cada una de ellas."
    "They also talk about the family and each other's plans."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3237
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_2fd41570:

    # "[kim] llama 'Abuela' un par de veces a [mee]."
    "[kim] calls [mee] 'Grandma' a couple of times."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3238
translate english c24s004_Kim_Mee_Meg_5b8e52db:

    # "Ninguna de ellas se da cuenta."
    "Neither of them notice."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3242
translate english c24s005_Ama_ee6ec8ff:

    # "De vuelta en la furgoneta..."
    "Back in the van..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3244
translate english c24s005_Ama_f22882bc:

    # ama "Disculpa, tenía que acabar de escribir algo que tienes que firmar."
    ama "Sorry, I had to finish writing something you have to sign."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3245
translate english c24s005_Ama_f5b226b8:

    # mc "¿Qué es?"
    mc "What is it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3247
translate english c24s005_Ama_c65a50a2:

    # ama "Aquí no. Te lo explico en tu habitación."
    ama "Not here. I'll explain it to you in your room."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3248
translate english c24s005_Ama_aed47ba9:

    # mc "¡Qué misteriosa! Pero es muy pronto para que venga el helicóptero ¿no?"
    mc "How mysterious! But it's too soon for the helicopter to come, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3250
translate english c24s005_Ama_98187efb:

    # ama "No va a venir aquí. No quieres que Iron Fist sepa dónde vives, ¿verdad?"
    ama "It's not coming here. You don't want Iron Fist to know where you live, do you?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3251
translate english c24s005_Ama_f29cba8a:

    # mc "Si tienen mi teléfono, supongo que también tienen mi dirección."
    mc "If they have my phone number, I guess they have my address too."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3253
translate english c24s005_Ama_13ff6026:

    # ama "En tu ficha de empleado de NTR figura tu teléfono, pero tu dirección es de San Luis Obispo."
    ama "Your NTR employee file lists your phone number, but your address is in San Luis Obispo."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3254
translate english c24s005_Ama_b4118369:

    # ama "*Risa* Vives en el campo de beisbol de la universidad. Por si teníamos algún topo."
    ama "*Laugh* You live at the university baseball field. In case we had any spies."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3255
translate english c24s005_Ama_a01d843a:

    # mc "*Risa* Espero que sea debajo de las gradas o me mojaré cuando llueva."
    mc "*Laugh* I hope it's under the bleachers or I'll get wet when it rains."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3256
translate english c24s005_Ama_e8a1b105:

    # mc "¿Dónde va a ir a buscarnos el helicóptero, entonces?"
    mc "Where's the helicopter going to pick us up, then?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3258
translate english c24s005_Ama_3cb607a6:

    # ama "Hemos alquilado un campo de tiro todo el fin de semana. Mañana por la tarde [eva] enseñará a disparar a algunas chicas."
    ama "We rented a shooting range for the whole weekend. Tomorrow afternoon, [eva] will teach some of the girls how to shoot."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3259
translate english c24s005_Ama_325b4e17:

    # ama "El helicóptero nos recogerá allí en cuatro horas."
    ama "The helicopter will pick us up there in four hours."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3260
translate english c24s005_Ama_827d0a03:

    # mc "OK. Voy a ducharme."
    mc "OK. I'm going to take a shower."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3262
translate english c24s005_Ama_8f56740e:

    # ama "Voy a saludar a [mar] y te veo en 15 minutos en tu habitación."
    ama "I'm going to say hi to [mar] and I'll see you in 15 minutes in your room."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3263
translate english c24s005_Ama_525112d5:

    # mc "¿15 minutos? Acabo de decir que me tenía que duchar. ¡Tenemos cuatro horas!"
    mc "15 minutes? I just said I had to shower. We have four hours!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3264
translate english c24s005_Ama_7deaa528:

    # ama "*Risa* La última vez que te espié duchándote, no eras tan lento como [emm]. ¿Te tienes que maquillar y depilar las piernas?"
    ama "*Laugh* Last time I spied on you showering, you weren't as slow as [emm]. Do you have to put on makeup and shave your legs?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3265
translate english c24s005_Ama_d1f01a44:

    # mc "*Risa* Vale, 15 minutos ¿Qué llevas en esa bolsa?"
    mc "*Laugh* Okay, 15 minutes. What's in that bag?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3266
translate english c24s005_Ama_1ca49a82:

    # ama "Lo que vas a firmar y lo que te vas a poner."
    ama "What you're going to sign and what you're going to wear."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3268
translate english c24s005_Ama_738d9a61:

    # "15 minutos después..."
    "15 minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3269
translate english c24s005_Ama_2dcb8dae:

    # mc "Ya estoy aquí. ¿Qué querías que firmara? ¿Y por qué tanta prisa?"
    mc "I'm done. What did you want me to sign? What's the hurry?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3272
translate english c24s005_Ama_1eadca4e:

    # "[ama] se levanta y te da un tierno beso."
    "[ama] gets up and gives you a tender kiss."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3274
translate english c24s005_Ama_a4e24b27:

    # ama "Primero, mis labios..."
    ama "First, my lips..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3275
translate english c24s005_Ama_d9236e6a:

    # mc "Me parece la forma ideal de empezar una reunión de trabajo."
    mc "I think it's the ideal way to start a business meeting."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3277
translate english c24s005_Ama_d0b258b1:

    # ama "*Risa* Espero que no hagas lo mismo con Ichigo esta noche."
    ama "*Laugh* I hope you won't do the same with Ichigo this evening."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3278
translate english c24s005_Ama_8d80c347:

    # mc "No, eso solo lo hago con mercenarias rubias."
    mc "No, I only do that with blonde mercenaries."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3279
translate english c24s005_Ama_a7fbeadb:

    # ama "*Risa* Que no te oiga [eva]."
    ama "*Laugh* Don't let [eva] hear you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3281
translate english c24s005_Ama_de43ceea:

    # "[ama] se gira para sacar algo de la bolsa de viaje que ha traído."
    "[ama] turns to take something out of the travel bag she's brought."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3282
translate english c24s005_Ama_3fef17f8:

    # "Las vistas son excelentes."
    "The view is excellent."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3284
translate english c24s005_Ama_9b4bf20c:

    # ama "Lo siguiente que tienes que firmar es esto. Hoy es tu primer día como CEO y el primer documento que vas a firmar."
    ama "The thing you have to sign is this. Today is your first day as acting CEO and this is the first document you're going to sign."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3287
translate english c24s005_Ama_c3551559:

    # ama "Dame un segundo."
    ama "Give me a second."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3288
translate english c24s005_Ama_85ade774:

    # "[ama] se agacha para sacar algo de la bolsa de viaje que ha traído."
    "[ama] bends over to get something out of the travel bag she brought."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3290
translate english c24s005_Ama_f3f3881d:

    # ama "Tienes que firmar es esto. Hoy es tu primer día como CEO y el primer documento que vas a firmar."
    ama "You have to sign is this. Today is your first day as acting CEO and this is the first document you are going to sign."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3292
translate english c24s005_Ama_3bca18c7:

    # "[ama] te entrega un papel escrito a mano, con varios tachones."
    "[ama] hands you a handwritten piece of paper, with several strikeouts on it."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3302
translate english c24s005_Ama_15062ef8:

    # "Carta de autorización"
    "Authorization letter"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3303
translate english c24s005_Ama_92f35414:

    # "Como CEO de NTR, por la presente autorizo a la Srta. Gilford a realizar un estudio exhaustivo de las necesidades"
    "As the CEO of NTR, I hereby authorize Ms. Gilford to undertake a comprehensive study of the relevant needs"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3304
translate english c24s005_Ama_55b4d0ec:

    # "y requisitos pertinentes para establecer la Beca NTR para el próximo año académico."
    "and requirements for establishing the NTR Scholarship for the next scholar year."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3305
translate english c24s005_Ama_105a3ed5:

    # "Esta beca {s}del programa{/s} tiene como objetivo apoyar a los nadadores de Newport que han decidido abandonar la natación de competición"
    "This {s}program{/s} scholarship aims to support Newport swimmers who have decided to abandon competitive swimming"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3306
translate english c24s005_Ama_7e68bbd5:

    # "y {s}desean{/s} aspiran a convertirse en entrenadores de natación."
    "and are {s}wanting{/s} aspiring to become swimming trainers."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3307
translate english c24s005_Ama_5e0df578:

    # "A la Srta. Gilford se le confían las siguientes responsabilidades:"
    "Ms. Gilford is entrusted with the following responsibilities:"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3308
translate english c24s005_Ama_f6a40645:

    # "*Realizar una evaluación exhaustiva para determinar los criterios y requisitos específicos para {s}la{/s} esta nueva beca."
    "• Conducting a thorough assessment needs to determine the specific criteria and requirements for {s}this{/s} the scholarship."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3309
translate english c24s005_Ama_e1fac448:

    # "*Interactuar con posibles {s}estudiantes{/s} candidatos para comprender sus motivaciones, desafíos y aspiraciones en la transición de nadadores a entrenadores."
    "• Engaging with potential {s}students{/s} candidates to understand their motivations, challenges, and aspirations in transitioning from swimmers to trainers."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3310
translate english c24s005_Ama_6f084748:

    # "*Colaborar con clubes de natación locales, instituciones educativas y partes interesadas relevantes para desarrollar un marco de becas sólido."
    "• Collaborating with local swimming clubs, educational institutions, and relevant stakeholders to develop a robust scholarship framework."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3312
translate english c24s005_Ama_504d1964:

    # "*Asegurarse de que la beca proporcione el apoyo financiero, los recursos y las oportunidades de desarrollo profesional adecuados para los candidatos seleccionados."
    "• Ensuring that the scholarship provides adequate financial support, resources, and opportunities for professional development for the selected candidates."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3311
translate english c24s005_Ama_f54b3c12:

    # "Se espera que la Srta. Gilford presente sus conclusiones y recomendaciones en los próximos tres días,"
    "Ms. Gilford is expected to present her findings and recommendations within the next three days,"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3312
translate english c24s005_Ama_bb1971f7:

    # "tras lo cual se desarrollará la estructura final y el plan de implementación de la Beca NTR."
    "upon which the final structure and implementation plan for the NTR Scholarship will be developed."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3313
translate english c24s005_Ama_0419c24d:

    # "Esta autorización entra en vigor inmediatamente y permanecerá vigente hasta la finalización del proyecto."
    "This authorization is effective immediately and will remain in force until the completion of the project."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3314
translate english c24s005_Ama_29859d0b:

    # "Firmado:"
    "Signed:"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3315
translate english c24s005_Ama_31adcaef:

    # "[mc] Marks"
    "[mc] Marks"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3316
translate english c24s005_Ama_eae190af:

    # "CEO de NTR"
    "CEO, NTR"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3320
translate english c24s005_Ama_220637b1:

    # mc "Esto es la creación de una beca hecha a medida para [sim]. 'Nadadores de Newport que han decidido abandonar la natación de competición y aspiran a convertirse en entrenadores'."
    "This is the creation of a tailor-made scholarship for [sim]. 'Newport swimmers who have decided to abandon competitive swimming and are aspiring to become swimming trainers.'."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3321
translate english c24s005_Ama_1856ed1b:

    # ama "He oído vuestra conversación en la piscina y he creído que, con todo el mal que ha hecho NTR, es hora de que haga algo bueno."
    ama "I listened to your conversation in the pool, and I thought that... with all the bad that NTR has done, it's time for it to do something good."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3322
translate english c24s005_Ama_1fadd701:

    # mc "Pero puedes hacer esto sin mi autorización. Tú también eres accionista."
    mc "But you can do this without my authorization. You are also a shareholder."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3324
translate english c24s005_Ama_0434ed66:

    # ama "Todavía no tengo un cargo oficial en NTR, con lo que no puedo hacerlo. Tiene que ser todo legal si queremos que la empresa evolucione, [mc]."
    ama "I don't have an official position at NTR yet, so I can't do it. It has to be all legal if we want the company to evolve, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3325
translate english c24s005_Ama_2ae863ca:

    # ama "La estaba acabando de escribir en la furgoneta. De ahí los tachones."
    ama "I was finishing it in the van. Hence the strikethroughs."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3326
translate english c24s005_Ama_42507974:

    # mc "*Risa* Le quitan un punto de oficialidad, pero supongo que es igual de legal."
    mc "*Laugh* They take away a bit of the officiality, but I guess it's just as legal."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3327
translate english c24s005_Ama_ade9dc87:

    # mc "Y tú vuelves a demostrar que eres una mujer increíble."
    mc "And you prove once again what an incredible woman you are."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3328
translate english c24s005_Ama_88b0999c:

    # "Firmas el documento."
    "You sign the document."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3330
translate english c24s005_Ama_409b61d4:

    # ama "Gracias, pero no hay nada que no estuviera dispuesta a hacer por esta familia."
    ama "Thank you, but there is nothing I wouldn't be willing to do for this family."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3331
translate english c24s005_Ama_8f570b82:

    # ama "Haga lo que haga, nunca os podré devolver lo que me estáis dando vosotros."
    ama "Whatever I do, I will never be able to repay you for what you are giving me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3332
translate english c24s005_Ama_38dcce63:

    # mc "La familia no es un negocio, [ama]. No hay que pesar lo que se da o se recibe. Pero tú estás dando mucho."
    mc "Family is not a business, [ama]. There is no balancing out of what is given or received. But you are giving a lot."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3334
translate english c24s005_Ama_f3231476:

    # ama "Y lo siguiente es lo que te vas a poner esta tarde."
    ama "And the next thing is what you are going to wear this afternoon."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3335
translate english c24s005_Ama_4a49ef0b:

    # mcp "(Como siempre, cambiando de tema en el momento en que alguien la alaba. Al menos esta vez sonríe.)"
    mcp "(As always, she changes the subject the moment someone praises her. At least this time she smiles.)"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3336
translate english c24s005_Ama_c607143e:

    # mc "¿Mis trajes no son adecuados para la reunión con Iron Fist?"
    mc "Are my suits not good enough for the meeting with Iron Fist?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3338
translate english c24s005_Ama_ce59d6cf:

    # ama "Sí, y ahora me darás uno. El que te pondrás esta noche."
    ama "Yes, and you will give me one. The one you will wear this evening."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3339
translate english c24s005_Ama_eb603de7:

    # mc "No lo entiendo. ¿Me traes un traje para la tarde y yo te doy uno para la noche? ¿Me voy a cambiar en el yate?"
    mc "I don't understand. You bring me a suit for the afternoon, and I give you one for the evening? Am I going to change on the yacht?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3341
translate english c24s005_Ama_92867519:

    # ama "¿No has hablado con [eva]?"
    ama "Haven't you talked to [eva]?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3342
translate english c24s005_Ama_9e545ae0:

    # mc "Hoy no. ¿Por qué?"
    mc "Not today. Why?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3343
translate english c24s005_Ama_1ac21101:

    # ama "Te tenía que haber llamado esta mañana."
    ama "She was supposed to call you this morning."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3344
translate english c24s005_Ama_38fa9700:

    # mc "He dormido hasta tarde y me quedé sin batería anoche. Lo he puesto a cargar cuando me he levantado. Ni siquiera lo he encendido aún."
    mc "Well, I slept late and my battery died last night. I put it on charge when I got up. I haven't even turned it on yet."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3346
translate english c24s005_Ama_7478643a:

    # ama "Eso lo explica todo."
    ama "That explains everything."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3347
translate english c24s005_Ama_1b5b5f4b:

    # ama "Vas a hacer prácticas de tiro con [eva] antes de ir a la reunión. Dice que no has practicado más después del primer día en el bosque."
    ama "You're going to do target practice with [eva] before going to the meeting. She says you didn't practice any more after the first day in the forest."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3348
translate english c24s005_Ama_e2d41494:

    # mc "¿Por eso habéis alquilado el campo de tiro?"
    mc "Is that why you rented the shooting range?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3350
translate english c24s005_Ama_147bd032:

    # ama "Por eso, para enseñar a las chicas a disparar, y para que venga el helicóptero a buscarnos."
    ama "Yes, to teach the girls how to shoot, and so the helicopter can come and pick us up."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3353
translate english c24s005_Ama_8c75a391:

    # ama "[eva] quería pasar un rato a solas contigo. Ella no lo llama cita sino entrenamiento."
    ama "[eva] wanted to spend some time alone with you. She doesn't call it a date, but training."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3354
translate english c24s005_Ama_26751aa9:

    # ama "Pero no lo dudes. Es una cita. Con armas en vez de con comida o vino."
    ama "But don't have any doubts. It's a date. With guns instead of food or wine."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3355
translate english c24s005_Ama_6c430bd0:

    # mc "¿No crees que me lo debería haber preguntado antes a mí?"
    mc "Don't you think she should have asked me first?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3357
translate english c24s005_Ama_e48042ab:

    # ama "*Risa* Si no te hubieras quedado sin batería o lo hubieras encendido..."
    ama "*Laugh* If you hadn't run out of battery or turned the phone on..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3358
translate english c24s005_Ama_3069ddbb:

    # mc "*Risa* Touché."
    mc "*Laugh* Touché."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3359
translate english c24s005_Ama_28d7ea60:

    # mc "¿Qué tengo que ponerme para la cita?"
    mc "What should I wear for the date?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3361
translate english c24s005_Ama_a580d8cf:

    # ama "Lo que hay en la bolsa. Te espero fuera mientras te cambias."
    ama "What is in the bag. I'll wait outside while you change."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3363
translate english c24s005_Ama_0ecf28f9:

    # mc "Sabes que no es necesario, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know it's not necessary, right?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3365
translate english c24s005_Ama_509365cd:

    # ama "*Risa* Si te desnudas delante mío, es posible que no llegues a la cita con [eva]."
    ama "*Laugh* If you get naked in front of me, you might not make it to the date with [eva]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3366
translate english c24s005_Ama_208599b9:

    # ama "*Risa* Y seguramente me lo haría pagar. De forma dolorosa. Mientras duermo."
    ama "*Laugh* And she'd probably make me pay. Painfully. In my sleep."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3368
translate english c24s005_Ama_e79e417a:

    # mc "OK. En dos minutos estaré vestido."
    mc "OK. I'll be dressed in two minutes."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3372
translate english c24s005_Ama_1bdbea1e:

    # ama "Ponte lo que hay en la bolsa. Te espero fuera mientras te cambias."
    ama "Put on what's in the bag. I'll wait outside while you change."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3374
translate english c24s005_Ama_0ecf28f9_1:

    # mc "Sabes que no es necesario, ¿verdad?"
    mc "You know it's not necessary, right?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3376
translate english c24s005_Ama_047ab889:

    # ama "*Risa* Si te desnudas delante mío, es posible que no llegues a la clase de tiro con [eva]."
    ama "*Laugh* If you get naked in front of me, you might not make it to the shooting lesson with [eva]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3377
translate english c24s005_Ama_208599b9_1:

    # ama "*Risa* Y seguramente me lo haría pagar. De forma dolorosa. Mientras duermo."
    ama "*Laugh* And she'd probably make me pay. Painfully. In my sleep."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3379
translate english c24s005_Ama_e79e417a_1:

    # mc "OK. En dos minutos estaré vestido."
    mc "OK. I'll be dressed in two minutes."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3381
translate english c24s005_Ama_dda3e113:

    # ama "Saca el traje que te vas a poner para el yate."
    ama "Get the suit you're going to wear for the yacht."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3383
translate english c24s005_Ama_0d0a47eb:

    # "Dos minutos después..."
    "Two minutes later..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3384
translate english c24s005_Ama_1a08177b:

    # mc "[ama], ya estoy vestido. Aunque no entiendo para qué necesito esto..."
    mc "[ama], I'm dressed. Although I don't understand why I need this..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3386
translate english c24s005_Ama_cac620c4:

    # ama "*Risa* ¡Estás ridículo!"
    ama "*Laugh* You look ridiculous!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3387
translate english c24s005_Ama_b2246951:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo sé. Más que a practicar tiro, parece que voy a hacer una carrera en Laguna Seca."
    mc "*Laugh* I know. It's more like I'm going to a race at Laguna Seca than to a shooting range."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3390
translate english c24s005_Ama_027cb8e1:

    # ama "*Risa* Bueno, esa es la otra parte de la cita con [eva]."
    ama "*Laugh* Well, that's the other part of the date with [eva]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3391
translate english c24s005_Ama_736e1139:

    # ama "¿Has montado en moto alguna vez?"
    ama "Have you ever ridden a motorcycle?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3392
translate english c24s005_Ama_cc761816:

    # mc "No..."
    mc "No..."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3394
translate english c24s005_Ama_30e93606:

    # ama "Pues hoy va a ser tu primera vez. [eva] quería que fueras seguro. El traje lo ha elegido ella."
    ama "Well, today will be your first time. [eva] wanted you to be safe. She chose the suit."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3395
translate english c24s005_Ama_0d907c5a:

    # ama "Es uno de los trajes de skydiving de NTR. Era lo más adecuado que teníamos para ti."
    ama "It's one of NTR's skydiving suits. It was the most suitable one we had for you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3396
translate english c24s005_Ama_4058bc50:

    # mc "¿No vamos a ir en la furgoneta al campo de tiro?"
    mc "Aren't we going to the shooting range in the van?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3398
translate english c24s005_Ama_6c2bceab:

    # ama "No, te lleva [eva]. Yo me quedaré con [mar] y [nor], pasando la tarde hasta que se acerque la hora de que llegue el helicóptero."
    ama "No, [eva] will drive you there. I'll stay with [mar] and [nor], spending the afternoon until it's almost time for the helicopter to arrive."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3399
translate english c24s005_Ama_5eda9e51:

    # mc "*Risa* Es decir, motos y armas. ¿Alguna cosa peligrosa más?"
    mc "*Laugh* I mean, motorcycles and guns. Are there any other dangerous things?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3401
translate english c24s005_Ama_e6a8262e:

    # ama "*Risa* [eva]."
    ama "*Laugh* [eva]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3402
translate english c24s005_Ama_a1e0e3b7:

    # mc "*Risa* No me da miedo. Seguramente porque no soy capaz de imaginar la mitad de las cosas que puede hacerme."
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not afraid of her. Probably because I can't imagine half the things she could do to me."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3403
translate english c24s005_Ama_4bcaaf83:

    # mc "Bueno, las armas tampoco después del primer entrenamiento. Y las motos..."
    mc "Well, I'm not afraid of guns either after the first training session. And motorcycles...."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3405
translate english c24s005_Ama_e7521246:

    # "Suena una moto a toda velocidad por la carretera, todavía lejos."
    "You can hear a motorcycle speeding along the road, still a long way off."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3406
translate english c24s005_Ama_c629957a:

    # ama "Creo que la tuya está llegando."
    ama "I think yours is coming."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3407
translate english c24s005_Ama_83b2b023:

    # mc "Te veo luego, entonces."
    mc "See you later, then."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3408
translate english c24s005_Ama_162ef4fb:

    # ama "Sí, cuando falten 20 minutos para que llegue el helicóptero, iré al campo de tiro. Así tienes tiempo de cambiarte."
    ama "Yes, when there are 20 minutes left before the helicopter arrives, I'll go to the shooting range. That way you have time to change."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3411
translate english c24s005_Ama_18f5f726:

    # "[ama] se despide de ti con otro tierno beso."
    "[ama] says goodbye with another tender kiss."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3412
translate english c24s005_Ama_689458b3:

    # ama "Te veo luego."
    ama "See you later."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3414
translate english c24s005_Ama_5b63b58c:

    # "Mientras bajas las escaleras, enciendes el móvil. Tienes 32 llamadas perdidas de [eva]. Y 24 mensajes de texto."
    "As you walk down the stairs, you turn on your cell phone. You have 32 missed calls from [eva]. And 24 texts."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3418
translate english c24s005_Eva_5f0fa22f:

    # "Al salir a la calle, [eva] ya te está esperando."
    "As you step outside, [eva] is already waiting for you."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3419
translate english c24s005_Eva_3b8ddfb4:

    # mc "Hola, [eva]."
    mc "Hi, [eva]."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3422
translate english c24s005_Eva_6f818418:

    # "[eva] salta a tus brazos buscando tus labios. Hace días que no os habéis besado."
    "[eva] jumps into your arms, looking for your lips. It's been days since you last kissed."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3424
translate english c24s005_Eva_6c435b77:

    # eva "Hola, [mc]. ¿Preparado para el entrenamiento?"
    eva "Hi, [mc]. Ready for training?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3425
translate english c24s005_Eva_e69ff49e:

    # mc "*Risa* Para el entrenamiento sí. Para la moto no tanto."
    mc "*Laugh* For training, yes. For the bike, not so much."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3427
translate english c24s005_Eva_0d100dc8:

    # "[eva] te pega un puñetazo en el hombro. No es un puñetazo suave. Los matones del colegio te pegaban más flojo."
    "[eva] punches you on the shoulder. Not a gentle punch. The bullies at school hit you softer."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3428
translate english c24s005_Eva_eb7708ca:

    # mc "¡Ouch! ¿A qué ha venido eso?"
    mc "Ouch! What was that for?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3429
translate english c24s005_Eva_81215681:

    # eva "A que así aprenderás a responder a mis llamadas."
    eva "So you'll learn to answer my calls."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3430
translate english c24s005_Eva_6b7cc6ac:

    # mc "¡Me quedé sin batería y no me he acordado de encenderlo hasta hace un momento!"
    mc "My phone ran out of battery, and I didn't remember to turn it on until just now!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3432
translate english c24s005_Eva_4f44b872:

    # eva "Seguro que no se te vuelve a olvidar."
    eva "I'm making sure you won't forget again."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3434
translate english c24s005_Eva_37099f52:

    # eva "¿Has montado alguna vez en moto?"
    eva "Have you ever ridden a motorcycle before?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3435
translate english c24s005_Eva_ce0ec26c:

    # mc "No... ¿Hay algo que deba saber?"
    mc "No... Is there anything I should know?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3436
translate english c24s005_Eva_cb9f023f:

    # eva "Tan solo agárrate fuerte a mí e intenta no moverte demasiado. Actúa como si fueras mi mochila."
    eva "Just hold on tight to me and try not to move around too much. Act like you're my backpack."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3438
translate english c24s005_Eva_45865617:

    # eva "*Risa* Y no grites ni llores en las curvas."
    eva "*Laugh* And don't scream or cry on the curves."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3439
translate english c24s005_Eva_6a83a2b3:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo intentaré, pero no prometo nada."
    mc "*Laugh* I'll try, but I can't promise anything."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3440
translate english c24s005_Eva_0619b416:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿En las rectas puedo llorar?"
    mc "*Laugh* Can I cry on the straight stretches?"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3442
translate english c24s005_Eva_c5e1570a:

    # eva "*Risa* Puedes hacerlo, pero no te voy a oír ni voy a parar."
    eva "*Laugh* You can, but I won't hear you and I won't stop."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3444
translate english c24s005_Eva_8e46c040:

    # eva "¡Sube en la moto!"
    eva "Get on the bike!"

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3450
translate english c24s005_Eva_2ad01fba:

    # "[eva] arranca para llevarte a la cita más extraña de tu vida."
    "[eva] starts the bike to take you to the strangest date of your life."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3452
translate english c24s005_Eva_08fe7d89:

    # "[eva] arranca para llevarte al entrenamiento más extraño de tu vida."
    "[eva] starts the bike to take you to the strangest training of your life."

# game/scripts/c24/c24.rpy:3453
translate english c24s005_Eva_257de6ea:

    # "Consigues no gritar en la primera curva pese al frenazo de [eva]. Te comportas como una buena mochila."
    "You manage not to scream in the first curve despite [eva]'s sudden braking. You behave like a good backpack."

